        "Note:": "Nota:",
        "Nothing found to archive.": "No se ha encontrado nada que archivar.",
        "Notice any restlessness in your body. The urge to check, to scroll, to reach for something. Just notice it.": "Observa cualquier inquietud en tu cuerpo. Las ganas de consultar, de deslizar, de buscar algo. Solo obs\xE9rvalas.",
        "Notice how they hold their shoulders. Their eyes. The pace of their words. Feel it in your own body now.": "Observa c\xF3mo coloca los hombros. Sus ojos. El ritmo de sus palabras. Si\xE9ntelo ahora en tu propio cuerpo.",
        "Notice the home you live in. Walk through it slowly. Touch the surfaces. Feel how it feels to be here.": "Observa la casa en la que vives. Rec\xF3rrela despacio. Toca las superficies. Siente c\xF3mo es estar aqu\xED.",
        "Notice where that doubt lives in your body. A tightness. A heaviness. Just locate it.": "Observa d\xF3nde vive esa duda en tu cuerpo. Una tensi\xF3n. Un peso. Solo local\xEDzala.",
        "Notice your body. How do you carry yourself? How do you move, breathe, stand?": "Observa tu cuerpo. \xBFC\xF3mo te sostienes? \xBFC\xF3mo te mueves, respiras, te quedas de pie?",
        "Notice: nothing outside you changed. Only what you looked at. This is a superpower.": "Observa: nada fuera de ti ha cambiado. Solo aquello a lo que mirabas. Esto es un superpoder.",
        "Notice: the urge is already softer. You are stronger than the pull.": "Observa: el impulso ya es m\xE1s suave. Eres m\xE1s fuerte que esa atracci\xF3n.",
        "Noticed {n} resistance thoughts.": "Has detectado {n} pensamientos de resistencia.",
        "Notification permission granted.": "Permiso de notificaciones concedido.",
        "Notifications are blocked in the browser. Allow them to receive nudges.": "El navegador bloquea las notificaciones. Perm\xEDtelas para recibir recordatorios.",
        "Now": "Ahora",
        "Now find your future self in this life. Look into their eyes. They are calm, clear, and proud of you.": "Ahora encuentra a tu yo del futuro en esta vida. M\xEDrale a los ojos. Transmite calma, claridad y orgullo por ti.",
        "Now it is three years. The projects you were going to start are still ideas. Notice what you stopped mentioning to people.": "Ahora han pasado tres a\xF1os. Los proyectos que ibas a empezar siguen siendo ideas. Observa qu\xE9 has dejado de mencionar a los dem\xE1s.",
        "Now name your one task. Only one. Say it silently, clearly, as a single sentence.": "Ahora nombra tu \xFAnica tarea. Solo una. Dila en silencio, con claridad, en una sola frase.",
        "Now recognize: this is not truth. It is a story. Someone, or something, taught it to you.": "Ahora reconoce esto: no es la verdad. Es una historia. Alguien, o algo, te la ense\xF1\xF3.",
        "Now simply rest in this stillness. Nothing to fix. Nothing to chase. Just breathing.": "Ahora simplemente descansa en esta quietud. Nada que arreglar. Nada que perseguir. Solo respirar.",
        "Now think of something small from today. A taste. A sound. A moment of comfort. Thank it.": "Ahora piensa en algo peque\xF1o de hoy. Un sabor. Un sonido. Un momento de comodidad. Agrad\xE9celo.",
        "Now turn around. Walk back to the fork. Feel each step getting lighter.": "Ahora date la vuelta. Regresa a la bifurcaci\xF3n. Siente c\xF3mo cada paso se vuelve m\xE1s ligero.",
        "Now, from this place, look back at today. What is the one decision that moved you onto this road?": "Ahora, desde aqu\xED, vuelve la vista a hoy. \xBFCu\xE1l fue la decisi\xF3n que te puso en este camino?",
        "Now, why are you doing this? Not the small reason. The real one. Who are you becoming? Who are you doing it for?": "Ahora, \xBFpor qu\xE9 haces esto? No el motivo peque\xF1o. El verdadero. \xBFEn qui\xE9n te est\xE1s convirtiendo? \xBFPor qui\xE9n lo haces?",
