        "One Decision Away prioritizes directional honesty over high-pressure streak gamification. Missed days are data points, not failures.": "One Decision Away prioriza la honestidad sobre tu rumbo frente a la presi\xF3n de las rachas gamificadas. Los d\xEDas perdidos son datos, no fracasos.",
