        "Settle in. Let your shoulders soften and let a small smile rest on your lips, even if it feels silly.": "Ponte a gusto. Suelta los hombros y deja que una peque\xF1a sonrisa repose en tus labios, aunque te parezca algo tonto.",
        "Settles the restless urge for quick hits and re-anchors your reward system to meaningful action.": "Calma el impulso inquieto de buscar recompensas r\xE1pidas y vuelve a vincular tu sistema de recompensa con acciones que importan.",
