        "~1 day": "~1 d\xEDa",
        "{count} scientific publications were reviewed before the lessons were written, alongside official health guidance. Findings were adapted into original daily exercises. ODA courses themselves have not been clinically tested; they are for education and personal practice.": "Antes de escribir las lecciones se revisaron {count} publicaciones cient\xEDficas y gu\xEDas sanitarias oficiales. Los hallazgos se adaptaron a ejercicios diarios originales. Los cursos de ODA no se han probado cl\xEDnicamente; son para educaci\xF3n y pr\xE1ctica personal.",
        "Source": "Fuente",
        "5\u20139 minutes for yourself in each lesson.": "5\u20139 minutos para ti en cada lecci\xF3n.",
        "Technique": "T\xE9cnica",
        "What research says": "Qu\xE9 dice la investigaci\xF3n",
        "Technique from a book or teacher": "T\xE9cnica de un libro o maestro",
        "Smart timing": "Horario inteligente",
        "At most two reminders a day: a morning nudge if you haven\u2019t chosen yet, and one around {time}, before you usually keep your decision. Nothing once it\u2019s done.": "Como m\xE1ximo dos recordatorios al d\xEDa: uno por la ma\xF1ana si a\xFAn no has elegido y otro hacia las {time}, antes de la hora en que sueles cumplir tu decisi\xF3n. Nada una vez hecha.",
        "At most two reminders a day: a morning nudge if you haven\u2019t chosen yet, and one in the evening. After three kept decisions, ODA learns your usual time.": "Como m\xE1ximo dos recordatorios al d\xEDa: uno por la ma\xF1ana si a\xFAn no has elegido y otro por la tarde. Tras tres decisiones cumplidas, ODA aprende tu hora habitual.",
        "Smart timing applies on this device while ODA is open or installed. Background reminders from the server still use the times below.": "El horario inteligente funciona en este dispositivo mientras ODA est\xE1 abierta o instalada. Los recordatorios del servidor en segundo plano siguen usando las horas de abajo.",
        "Try it in 20 seconds": "Pru\xE9balo en 20 segundos",
        "One decision. A small start. Proof.": "Una decisi\xF3n. Un peque\xF1o comienzo. Una prueba.",
        "This is how every day in ODA works. Try one round before we set anything up.": "As\xED funciona cada d\xEDa en ODA. Prueba una ronda antes de configurar nada.",
        "1. Pick a decision for today:": "1. Elige una decisi\xF3n para hoy:",
        "2. Start \xB7 just 2 minutes": "2. Empieza \xB7 solo 2 minutos",
        "Here the two minutes pass in a few seconds.": "Aqu\xED los dos minutos pasan en unos segundos.",
