        "Email me a sign-in link": "Env\xEDame un enlace de acceso",
        "New here? The same link creates your account.": "\xBFEres nuevo? El mismo enlace crea tu cuenta.",
        "Why sign in": "Por qu\xE9 iniciar sesi\xF3n",
        "Backed up": "Con copia de seguridad",
        "A lost or reset phone no longer means lost progress.": "Perder o reiniciar el m\xF3vil ya no significa perder tu progreso.",
        "On every device": "En cada dispositivo",
        "The same decisions and notes on your phone and laptop.": "Las mismas decisiones y notas en tu m\xF3vil y tu port\xE1til.",
        "Only yours": "Solo tuyo",
        "Your data can be read only with your account.": "Tus datos solo se pueden leer con tu cuenta.",
        "You can keep using ODA without an account; nothing changes.": "Puedes seguir usando ODA sin cuenta; nada cambia.",
        "Sign in to back up and sync": "Inicia sesi\xF3n para respaldar y sincronizar",
        "Sign in": "Iniciar sesi\xF3n",
        "so your proof is backed up and on every device.": "para que tus pruebas tengan copia y est\xE9n en cada dispositivo.",
        "Automatic": "Autom\xE1tico",
        "I did it": "Lo hice",
        "Kept today": "Cumplido hoy",
        "About": "Acerca de",
        "Privacy policy": "Pol\xEDtica de privacidad",
        "Terms of use": "T\xE9rminos de uso",
        "\xA9 {year} {company} \xB7 One Decision Away": "\xA9 {year} {company} \xB7 One Decision Away",
        "Your answers and reflections are never sold or shared.": "Tus respuestas y reflexiones nunca se venden ni se comparten.",
        "You are not signed in.": "No has iniciado sesi\xF3n.",
        "We couldn\u2019t delete your account. Check your connection and try again.": "No pudimos eliminar tu cuenta. Revisa tu conexi\xF3n e int\xE9ntalo de nuevo.",
        "Your account and cloud backup are deleted. What is on this device stays until you reset it in Settings.": "Tu cuenta y tu copia en la nube se han borrado. Lo que hay en este dispositivo se queda hasta que lo restablezcas en Ajustes.",
        "Delete account": "Eliminar cuenta",
        "Permanently deletes your account and everything backed up in the cloud. What is on this device stays until you reset it in Settings.": "Elimina para siempre tu cuenta y todo lo guardado en la nube. Lo que hay en este dispositivo se queda hasta que lo restablezcas en Ajustes.",
        "Delete my account": "Eliminar mi cuenta",
        "Delete your account?": "\xBFEliminar tu cuenta?",
