        "Your vision board": "Tu tablero de visi\xF3n",
        "Add a dream from Explore and it will appear here as a picture. Seeing what you are working toward makes it easier to keep going.": "A\xF1ade un sue\xF1o desde Explorar y aparecer\xE1 aqu\xED como imagen. Ver hacia d\xF3nde vas hace m\xE1s f\xE1cil seguir.",
