        "5-4-3-2-1 grounding": "Anclaje 5-4-3-2-1",
        "Finish": "Terminar",
        "You have named what is here, right now. Take one slow breath and see how you feel compared to a few minutes ago.": "Has nombrado lo que hay aqu\xED, ahora mismo. Respira lento una vez y observa c\xF3mo te sientes comparado con hace unos minutos.",
        "This is now your one decision for today.": "Esta es ahora tu \xFAnica decisi\xF3n de hoy.",
