        "Acknowledge someone who uplifts your standards or share your progress.": "Standartlar\u0131n\u0131 y\xFCkselten birine te\u015Fekk\xFCr et veya ilerlemeni payla\u015F.",
        "Acknowledge your progress so far and proceed with steady clarity.": "\u015Eimdiye kadarki ilerlemeni takdir et ve sakin bir netlikle devam et.",
