        'Acquiring this item places it into your "My Future Life" visual palace, where you can establish a tangible Reality Bridge and track physical savings.': 'Bu \xF6\u011Feyi edinince "Gelecekteki Hayat\u0131m" g\xF6rsel saray\u0131na yerle\u015Fir; burada somut bir Ger\xE7eklik K\xF6pr\xFCs\xFC kurabilir ve ger\xE7ek birikimlerini takip edebilirsin.',
        "Acquisition Simulation Grant": "Edinim Sim\xFClasyonu Deste\u011Fi",
