        "Active all-time personal best!": "\u015Eu anda t\xFCm zamanlar\u0131n ki\u015Fisel rekoru!",
        "Active daily focus momentum": "Etkin g\xFCnl\xFCk odak ivmesi",
        'Adapt the "{name}" template to your own goals and budget.': '"{name}" \u015Fablonunu kendi hedeflerine ve b\xFCt\xE7ene uyarla.',
        "Add Custom Dream": "\xD6zel Hayal Ekle",
