        "Dream Dollars (D$) are symbolic simulation tokens that cannot be purchased, gambled, or withdrawn. They act as a behavioral mirror for where your daily energy is invested.": "Hayal Dolar\u0131 (D$), sat\u0131n al\u0131namayan, kumarda kullan\u0131lamayan veya \xE7ekilemeyen sembolik sim\xFClasyon birimleridir. G\xFCnl\xFCk enerjini nereye harcad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 g\xF6steren davran\u0131\u015Fsal bir ayna g\xF6revi g\xF6r\xFCr.",
