        "Dream Dollars (D$) is a virtual simulation economy with no cash value. Purchases and allocations are symbolic representations of your life design.": "Hayal Dolar\u0131 (D$) nakit de\u011Feri olmayan sanal bir sim\xFClasyon ekonomisidir. Sat\u0131n al\u0131mlar ve da\u011F\u0131l\u0131mlar, ya\u015Fam tasar\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n sembolik temsilleridir.",
