        "Establish a strict 9:30 PM digital curfew tonight. Switch your phone to airplane mode and pick up a physical book.": "Bu gece saat 21:30'da kesin bir dijital kullan\u0131m s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 koy. Telefonunu u\xE7ak moduna al ve bas\u0131l\u0131 bir kitap a\xE7.",
