        "Evenings on a terrace with people you love.": "Sevdi\u011Fin insanlarla terasta ak\u015Famlar.",
        "Evenings that feel like a film, every single day.": "Her g\xFCn bir film gibi hissettiren ak\u015Famlar.",
        "Every Dream Dollar is a vote. Cast the first one before breakfast.": "Her Hayal Dolar\u0131 bir oydur. \u0130lkini kahvalt\u0131dan \xF6nce ver.",
        "Every completed mission deposits D$ into your ledger in the Dream Bank. No fake math, no pay-to-win mechanics, and anti-binge caps.": "Tamamlanan her g\xF6rev, Hayal Bankas\u0131 hesab\u0131na D$ yat\u0131r\u0131r. Yan\u0131lt\u0131c\u0131 hesap yok, \xF6deyerek kazanma yok; a\u015F\u0131r\u0131 kullan\u0131m\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131rlayan tavanlar var.",
        "Every completed mission is a non-negotiable vote cast directly for the reality of {dName}.": "Tamamlanan her g\xF6rev, {dName} ger\xE7e\u011Fi i\xE7in do\u011Frudan verilmi\u015F tavizsiz bir oydur.",
        "Every completed mission is a symbolic vote for the life you are building.": "Tamamlanan her g\xF6rev, in\u015Fa etti\u011Fin hayat i\xE7in sembolik bir oydur.",
        "Every curated home, car, watch, journey and experience \u2014 browse like a shop, choose like a builder.": "\xD6zenle se\xE7ilmi\u015F her ev, otomobil, saat, yolculuk ve deneyim \u2014 ma\u011Faza gezer gibi ke\u015Ffet, hayat\u0131n\u0131 in\u015Fa eden biri gibi se\xE7.",
        "Every disciplined decision today anchors {dName} from an abstract dream into an impending reality.": "Bug\xFCnk\xFC her disiplinli karar, {dName} hayalini soyut bir d\xFC\u015F\xFCnceden yakla\u015Fan bir ger\xE7e\u011Fe d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFCr\xFCr.",
        "Every second you stay here, doing nothing, you are building tolerance for boredom. That is strength.": "Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey yapmadan burada kald\u0131\u011F\u0131n her saniye, s\u0131k\u0131lmaya dayan\u0131kl\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131r\u0131yorsun. Bu bir g\xFC\xE7t\xFCr.",
        "Every temptation resisted is an immediate deposit into the reality of your future self.": "Direndi\u011Fin her cazibe, gelecekteki benli\u011Finin ger\xE7e\u011Fine an\u0131nda yap\u0131lan bir yat\u0131r\u0131md\u0131r.",
        "Every unfinished project, unanswered proposal, and lingering decision drains working memory. Killing or shipping an idea restores vitality.": "Bitmemi\u015F her proje, yan\u0131ts\u0131z teklif ve bekleyen karar \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma belle\u011Fini t\xFCketir. Bir fikri bitirmek veya b\u0131rakmak canl\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131 geri getirir.",
        "Examine Two Futures": "\u0130ki Gelece\u011Fi \u0130ncele",
        "Exceeds 100% by +{n}%": "%100'\xFC +{n}% a\u015F\u0131yor",
        "Excel / Sheets ready": "Excel / Sheets'e haz\u0131r",
        "Exceptional consistency. Two solid weeks of daily high-leverage decisions.": "Ola\u011Fan\xFCst\xFC istikrar. Etkisi y\xFCksek g\xFCnl\xFCk kararlarla dolu iki sa\u011Flam hafta.",
        "Exclusive-Use Tented Camp": "Tamamen Sana \xD6zel \xC7ad\u0131r Kamp\u0131",
        "Exclusive-use luxury tented camp following the Great Migration with sunrise hot-air ballooning, private guides, and open-fire dining.": "B\xFCy\xFCk G\xF6\xE7'\xFC izleyen, g\xFCn do\u011Fumunda balon u\xE7u\u015Fu, \xF6zel rehberler ve a\xE7\u0131k ate\u015Fte yemeklerle tamamen sana \xF6zel l\xFCks \xE7ad\u0131r kamp\u0131.",
