        "Execute today to ignite": "Ate\u015Flemek i\xE7in bug\xFCn harekete ge\xE7",
        "Execute vigorous 45m strength & metabolic conditioning session": "Yo\u011Fun 45 dk kuvvet ve metabolik kondisyon seans\u0131 yap",
        "Execute your active queue with unwavering sharpness.": "Etkin g\xF6rev s\u0131ran\u0131 sars\u0131lmaz bir netlikle tamamla.",
        "Execute your daily signature One Decision or mission quests to populate your weekly record.": "Haftal\u0131k kayd\u0131n\u0131 doldurmak i\xE7in g\xFCnl\xFCk imza Tek Karar\u0131n\u0131 veya g\xF6revlerini uygula.",
