        "Export and download your complete local workspace snapshot": "Yerel \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma alan\u0131n\u0131n tam anl\u0131k g\xF6r\xFCnt\xFCs\xFCn\xFC d\u0131\u015Fa aktar ve indir",
        "Export progress visualization and milestone nodes as a shareable high-res PNG image": "\u0130lerleme g\xF6rselini ve d\xF6n\xFCm noktalar\u0131n\u0131 payla\u015F\u0131labilir y\xFCksek \xE7\xF6z\xFCn\xFCrl\xFCkl\xFC PNG olarak d\u0131\u015Fa aktar",
