        "Fairy Chimneys": "Peribacalar\u0131",
        "Family Kitchen": "Aile Mutfa\u011F\u0131",
        "Family Space": "Aile Alan\u0131",
        "Fear Then Freedom": "\xD6nce Korku, Sonra \xD6zg\xFCrl\xFCk",
        "Fear is a poor long-term fuel, but a clear picture of the default path is a superb compass. Make it concrete, count what it costs, and notice the small moments you drift toward it.": "Korku uzun vadede iyi bir yak\u0131t de\u011Fildir; ama ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n yolun net resmi g\xFC\xE7l\xFC bir pusulad\u0131r. Somutla\u015Ft\u0131r, bedelini hesapla ve ona do\u011Fru s\xFCr\xFCklendi\u011Fin k\xFC\xE7\xFCk anlar\u0131 fark et.",
        "Fear of putting out work and having it meet total silence.": "Ortaya bir i\u015F koyup tam bir sessizlikle kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Fma korkusu.",
        "Feature it in your Daily Vision Affirmations on the Home page and on your Vision Board.": "Ana sayfadaki G\xFCnl\xFCk Vizyon Olumlamalar\u0131nda ve Vizyon Panonda \xF6ne \xE7\u0131kar.",
        "Featured Curations": "\xD6ne \xC7\u0131kan Se\xE7kiler",
        "Feedback & Iteration": "Geri Bildirim ve \u0130yile\u015Ftirme",
        "Feel Good": "\u0130yi Hisset",
        "Feel a quiet strength in your chest. Confidence is not loud. It is calm.": "G\xF6\u011Fs\xFCnde sessiz bir g\xFC\xE7 hisset. \xD6zg\xFCven g\xFCr\xFClt\xFCl\xFC de\u011Fildir. Sakindir.",
        "Feel a steady strength rising from the ground, up through your legs, into your spine. Quiet. Certain.": "Yerden y\xFCkselip bacaklar\u0131ndan omurgana ula\u015Fan sa\u011Flam bir g\xFC\xE7 hisset. Sessiz. Kesin.",
        "Feel energy building in your chest. A warm pressure. That is your drive. It was never gone, only buried.": "G\xF6\u011Fs\xFCnde biriken enerjiyi hisset. S\u0131cak bir bas\u0131n\xE7. Bu senin itici g\xFCc\xFCn. Hi\xE7 kaybolmad\u0131, yaln\u0131zca \xFCst\xFC \xF6rt\xFCld\xFC.",
        "Feel it in your hands. They want to work. Feel it in your legs. They want to stand.": "Ellerinde hisset. \xC7al\u0131\u015Fmak istiyorlar. Bacaklar\u0131nda hisset. Aya\u011Fa kalkmak istiyorlar.",
        "Feel the corners of your mouth lift a little more. Your body believes what you show it.": "Dudaklar\u0131n\u0131n k\xF6\u015Felerinin biraz daha y\xFCkseldi\u011Fini hisset. Bedenin ona g\xF6sterdi\u011Fine inan\u0131r.",
        "Feel the warmth in your chest expanding. Gratitude is not a thought. It is a feeling in the body.": "G\xF6\u011Fs\xFCndeki s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011F\u0131n yay\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hisset. Minnettarl\u0131k bir d\xFC\u015F\xFCnce de\u011Fildir. Bedende bir histir.",
        "Feel the weight of that evidence. You are not pretending. You are remembering.": "Bu kan\u0131t\u0131n a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hisset. Rol yapm\u0131yorsun. Hat\u0131rl\u0131yorsun.",
        "Feel this future in your body now. It is not a wish. It is a memory of something coming.": "Bu gelece\u011Fi \u015Fimdi bedeninde hisset. Bu bir dilek de\u011Fil. Yakla\u015Fan bir \u015Feyin an\u0131s\u0131.",
        "Feel your attention narrowing, like a lens coming into focus. Sharp. Bright. Still.": "Dikkatinin netle\u015Fen bir mercek gibi darald\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hisset. Keskin. Ayd\u0131nl\u0131k. Dingin.",
        "Feel your eyes growing heavier. Your face softening. Your jaw releasing.": "G\xF6zlerinin a\u011F\u0131rla\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hisset. Y\xFCz\xFCn\xFCn yumu\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131. \xC7enenin gev\u015Fedi\u011Fini.",
        "Feel your finances. Calm. Enough. Growing. Money is a tool in your hands, not a weight on your chest.": "Maddi durumunu hisset. Sakin. Yeterli. B\xFCy\xFCyor. Para g\xF6\u011Fs\xFCnde bir y\xFCk de\u011Fil, elinde bir ara\xE7.",
        "Feel your shoulders drop away from your ears. Let them become heavy.": "Omuzlar\u0131n\u0131n kulaklar\u0131ndan uzakla\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hisset. A\u011F\u0131rla\u015Fmalar\u0131na izin ver.",
