        "Guided narration stays in English. Built-in voices depend on your browser and installed voices; some need an internet connection. Gemini narration uses your own API key, stored on this device.": "Rehberli anlat\u0131m \u0130ngilizce kal\u0131r. Yerle\u015Fik sesler taray\u0131c\u0131na ve y\xFCkl\xFC seslere ba\u011Fl\u0131d\u0131r; baz\u0131lar\u0131 internet ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131 gerektirir. Gemini anlat\u0131m\u0131, bu cihazda saklanan kendi API anahtar\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131r.",
