        "Hold a weekly project retrospective": "Haftal\u0131k proje de\u011Ferlendirmesi yap",
        "Hold it. That is your One Decision. Not for someday. For today.": "Akl\u0131nda tut. Bu senin Tek Karar\u0131n. Bir g\xFCn i\xE7in de\u011Fil. Bug\xFCn i\xE7in.",
