        "Iconic Ducktail Spoiler": "\u0130konik \xD6rdek Kuyru\u011Fu Spoyler",
        "Iconic all-terrain luxury fortress featuring handcrafted diamond-stitched leather, side-pipe exhaust rumble, and triple locking differentials.": "El i\u015F\xE7ili\u011Fi baklava diki\u015Fli deri, yan egzoz g\xFCr\xFClt\xFCs\xFC ve \xFC\xE7l\xFC diferansiyel kilidiyle her araziye uygun ikonik l\xFCks kale.",
        "Ideas Room": "Fikir Odas\u0131",
        "Identify the one compromise you made yesterday that your Future Self would never accept. Refuse to repeat it today.": "D\xFCn verdi\u011Fin ve Gelecekteki Benli\u011Finin asla kabul etmeyece\u011Fi tek tavizi belirle. Bug\xFCn tekrarlamay\u0131 reddet.",
        "Identify the one task you have delayed 3 times this week. Execute its next concrete step before opening your inbox.": "Bu hafta 3 kez erteledi\u011Fin i\u015Fi belirle. Gelen kutunu a\xE7madan \xF6nce s\u0131radaki somut ad\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 at.",
        "Identity & Sovereignty": "Kimlik ve \xD6zg\xFCrl\xFCk",
        "Identity Expansion": "Kimli\u011Fin Geni\u015Flemesi",
        "Identity Labels to Release (1 per line)": "B\u0131rak\u0131lacak Kimlik Etiketleri (her sat\u0131ra 1)",
        "Identity is demonstrated through action in real-time, not through philosophical intentions.": "Kimlik, felsefi niyetlerle de\u011Fil, o anda yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n eylemlerle ortaya konur.",
        "Identity shift precedes behavioural change. Define who you are becoming and what you leave behind.": "Kimlik de\u011Fi\u015Fimi davran\u0131\u015F de\u011Fi\u015Fiminden \xF6nce gelir. Kime d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC ve neleri geride b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 tan\u0131mla.",
        "Identity statement": "Kimlik bildirisi",
        "Identity to release": "Geride b\u0131rak\u0131lacak kimlik",
        "If Nothing Changes \u2014 Timeline": "Hi\xE7bir \u015Eey De\u011Fi\u015Fmezse \u2014 Zaman \xC7izelgesi",
        "If a thought appears, let it drift past like a cloud, and return to the feeling of the breath.": "Bir d\xFC\u015F\xFCnce belirse, bulut gibi ge\xE7ip gitmesine izin ver ve nefesinin hissine d\xF6n.",
        "If distractions come, you will write them down and return. You do not chase them.": "Dikkat da\u011F\u0131t\u0131c\u0131lar gelirse onlar\u0131 yaz\u0131p geri d\xF6neceksin. Pe\u015Flerine d\xFC\u015Fmeyeceksin.",
        "If nothing changes, describe an ordinary Tuesday five years from now \u2014 wake-up to lights-out.": "Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Fmezse be\u015F y\u0131l sonraki s\u0131radan bir sal\u0131y\u0131 anlat \u2014 uyan\u0131\u015Ftan yat\u0131\u015Fa kadar.",
        "If nothing changes, describe an ordinary Tuesday five years from now.": "Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Fmezse be\u015F y\u0131l sonraki s\u0131radan bir sal\u0131y\u0131 anlat.",
        "If something went wrong, let it be. Tomorrow is a new chance. Tonight, you rest.": "Bir \u015Fey ters gittiyse b\u0131rak \xF6yle kals\u0131n. Yar\u0131n yeni bir \u015Fans. Bu gece dinleniyorsun.",
        "If the One Decision isn't done, this is the hour. 25 minutes, phone away.": "Tek Karar hen\xFCz tamamlanmad\u0131ysa zaman\u0131 \u015Fimdi. 25 dakika, telefon uzakta.",
        "If you want to go fast, go alone. If you want to go far, go together with clear vision and uncompromising standards.": "H\u0131zl\u0131 gitmek istiyorsan yaln\u0131z git. Uza\u011Fa gitmek istiyorsan net bir vizyon ve tavizsiz standartlarla birlikte git.",
        "Ignite Motivation": "Motivasyonu Ate\u015Fle",
        "Ignition": "Ate\u015Fleme",
        "Illuminated Tower Residence": "I\u015F\u0131kl\u0131 Kule Rezidans\u0131",
        "Image Background:": "G\xF6rsel Arka Plan\u0131:",
        "Image Preview (Ready for export)": "G\xF6rsel \xD6nizlemesi (D\u0131\u015Fa aktarmaya haz\u0131r)",
        "Image uploaded.": "G\xF6rsel y\xFCklendi.",
        "Imagine a door in front of you. On the other side is your life, three years from now, if you keep choosing well.": "\xD6n\xFCnde bir kap\u0131 hayal et. Di\u011Fer taraf\u0131nda, iyi se\xE7imler yapmay\u0131 s\xFCrd\xFCr\xFCrsen \xFC\xE7 y\u0131l sonra ya\u015Fayaca\u011F\u0131n hayat var.",
        "Imagine a road splitting in two. Take the left path first. This is the road where nothing changes.": "\u0130kiye ayr\u0131lan bir yol hayal et. \xD6nce soldan git. Hi\xE7bir \u015Feyin de\u011Fi\u015Fmedi\u011Fi yol bu.",
        "Imagine the feeling of finishing it. That quiet, deep satisfaction. That is real reward.": "Bitirdi\u011Findeki hissi hayal et. O sessiz, derin tatmini. Ger\xE7ek \xF6d\xFCl budur.",
        "Immutable Ledger Data": "De\u011Fi\u015Ftirilemez Hesap Verileri",
