        'No micro-habits defined yet. Click "Add Habit" to create your first 5-minute win.': 'Hen\xFCz mikro al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131k tan\u0131mlanmad\u0131. \u0130lk 5 dakikal\u0131k ba\u015Far\u0131n\u0131 olu\u015Fturmak i\xE7in "Al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131k Ekle"ye t\u0131kla.',
        "No micro-habits found. Create your first 5-minute habit on the Home page to start tracking weekly category trends.": "Mikro al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131k bulunamad\u0131. Haftal\u0131k kategori e\u011Filimlerini izlemeye ba\u015Flamak i\xE7in Ana Sayfada ilk 5 dakikal\u0131k al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 olu\u015Ftur.",
