        "No mission completion records logged on this day. D$ rewards came from micro-habits, check-ins, or focus time.": "Bu g\xFCn g\xF6rev tamamlama kayd\u0131 yok. D$ \xF6d\xFClleri mikro al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klardan, yoklamalardan veya odak s\xFCresinden geldi.",
