        "North-light studio with a big easel, a wall of brushes, and permission to make a mess.": "B\xFCy\xFCk \u015F\xF6valesi, f\u0131r\xE7alarla dolu duvar\u0131 ve da\u011F\u0131tma \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFC\u011F\xFCyle kuzey \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131 alan st\xFCdyo.",
        "Northern Lights Night": "Kuzey I\u015F\u0131klar\u0131 Gecesi",
