        "On the next breath, open your eyes and begin, without checking anything else first.": "Bir sonraki nefeste g\xF6zlerini a\xE7 ve \xF6nce ba\u015Fka hi\xE7bir \u015Feyi kontrol etmeden ba\u015Fla.",
        "On the next breath, you will open your eyes and go straight to the first action. No delay.": "Bir sonraki nefeste g\xF6zlerini a\xE7acak ve do\u011Frudan ilk eyleme ge\xE7eceksin. Gecikmeden.",
