        "One Decision Away": "One Decision Away",
        "One Decision Away Progress Visualization": "One Decision Away \u0130lerleme G\xF6rselle\u015Ftirmesi",
        "One Decision Away is built with ethical pricing. No pay-to-win mechanics, no selling user data, and transparent value.": "One Decision Away etik fiyatland\u0131rma anlay\u0131\u015F\u0131yla geli\u015Ftirilmi\u015Ftir. \xD6deyerek kazanma yok, kullan\u0131c\u0131 verisi sat\u0131\u015F\u0131 yok; \u015Feffaf de\u011Fer var.",
        "One Decision Away prioritizes directional honesty over high-pressure streak gamification. Missed days are data points, not failures.": "One Decision Away, bask\u0131 yaratan seri oyunla\u015Ft\u0131rmas\u0131 yerine y\xF6n\xFCn\xFC d\xFCr\xFCst\xE7e g\xF6rmene \xF6ncelik verir. Ka\xE7\u0131r\u0131lan g\xFCnler ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131zl\u0131k de\u011Fil, veri noktalar\u0131d\u0131r.",
