        "One Plant": "Tek Bitki",
        "One Question Today": "Bug\xFCn Tek Soru",
        "One Signature Decision every single day": "Her g\xFCn tek bir \u0130mza Karar",
        "One brave email. One hard workout. One honest page. Pick one.": "Cesur bir e-posta. Zorlu bir antrenman. D\xFCr\xFCst bir sayfa. Birini se\xE7.",
        "One by one, place each paper in a drawer. It will still be there later. Right now, it is closed.": "Her k\xE2\u011F\u0131d\u0131 tek tek \xE7ekmeceye koy. Sonra yine orada olacak. \u015Eu an kapal\u0131.",
        "One full week completed. Your momentum is carrying you forward effortlessly.": "Tam bir hafta tamamland\u0131. \u0130vmen seni zahmetsizce ileri ta\u015F\u0131yor.",
        "One honest paragraph is enough.": "D\xFCr\xFCst bir paragraf yeter.",
        "One meaningful action a day is how the future gets built. Pick it now, before the day picks for you.": "Gelecek, her g\xFCn anlaml\u0131 bir eylemle in\u015Fa edilir. G\xFCn senin yerine se\xE7meden \u015Fimdi sen se\xE7.",
        "One month bespoke private navigation along French & Italian Rivieras with onboard private chef, Seabobs, and secluded anchorage.": "Frans\u0131z ve \u0130talyan Rivieralar\u0131nda bir ay ki\u015Fiye \xF6zel seyir; teknede \xF6zel \u015Fef, Seabob\u2019lar ve sakin demirleme yerleri.",
        "One night you'll describe for the rest of your life.": "Hayat\u0131n boyunca anlataca\u011F\u0131n bir gece.",
        "One row per completion date with habit title, category, linked life goal, and streak at completion.": "Her tamamlama tarihi i\xE7in al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131k ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131, kategori, ba\u011Fl\u0131 ya\u015Fam hedefi ve tamamlama an\u0131ndaki seriyi i\xE7eren bir sat\u0131r.",
        "One row per micro-habit with lifetime completions, active streak, best streak, and linked goals.": "Her mikro al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131k i\xE7in toplam tamamlamalar, etkin seri, en iyi seri ve ba\u011Fl\u0131 hedefleri i\xE7eren bir sat\u0131r.",
        "One watch, for life, that goes everywhere.": "\xD6m\xFCr boyu, her yere giden tek bir saat.",
        "One year from now \u2014 if nothing changes": "Bir y\u0131l sonra \u2014 hi\xE7bir \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Fmezse",
        "One year. One decision every day. Small things, done anyway. Notice how your posture is different here.": "Bir y\u0131l. Her g\xFCn tek karar. Her \u015Feye ra\u011Fmen yap\u0131lan k\xFC\xE7\xFCk \u015Feyler. Burada duru\u015Funun nas\u0131l farkl\u0131 oldu\u011Funu fark et.",
        "One-Watch Collection": "Tek Saatten Olu\u015Fan Koleksiyon",
        "One-Way": "Tek Y\xF6n",
        "One-Year Mission (D$25,000)": "Bir Y\u0131ll\u0131k G\xF6rev (D$25,000)",
        "Open Air": "A\xE7\u0131k Hava",
        "Open Camera & Take a Photo": "Kameray\u0131 A\xE7 ve Foto\u011Fraf \xC7ek",
        "Open Dream Market": "Hayal Pazar\u0131n\u0131 A\xE7",
        "Open Life OS": "Life OS'yi A\xE7",
        "Open Navigation Menu": "Gezinme Men\xFCs\xFCn\xFC A\xE7",
        "Open Plan": "A\xE7\u0131k Plan",
        "Open Quick Dream Journal ({shortcut})": "H\u0131zl\u0131 Hayal G\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC A\xE7 ({shortcut})",
        "Open a dedicated sub-account for {name}": "{name} i\xE7in ayr\u0131 bir alt hesap a\xE7",
        "Open ambient tone": "A\xE7\u0131k ortam sesi",
        "Open family floor with a cinema wall, generous sofas, a play-and-study corner and a kitchen made for Sunday breakfasts.": "Sinema duvar\u0131, geni\u015F kanepeler, oyun ve \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma k\xF6\u015Fesi ve pazar kahvalt\u0131lar\u0131 i\xE7in tasarlanm\u0131\u015F mutfa\u011F\u0131yla a\xE7\u0131k aile kat\u0131.",
        "Open the Public Compass to answer them": "Yan\u0131tlamak i\xE7in Herkese A\xE7\u0131k Pusulay\u0131 a\xE7",
        "Open the door and step through. Look around. Where are you? What does the light look like?": "Kap\u0131y\u0131 a\xE7 ve i\xE7eri gir. Etraf\u0131na bak. Neredesin? I\u015F\u0131k nas\u0131l g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCyor?",
        "Open your eyes and bring this glow into the world.": "G\xF6zlerini a\xE7 ve bu \u0131\u015F\u0131lt\u0131y\u0131 d\xFCnyaya ta\u015F\u0131.",
        "Open your eyes and look for something to appreciate in the next sixty seconds.": "G\xF6zlerini a\xE7 ve \xF6n\xFCm\xFCzdeki altm\u0131\u015F saniyede takdir edece\u011Fin bir \u015Fey ara.",
