        "Ski-in / ski-out sanctuary with custom charred cedar framing, heated outdoor slate soaking pools, and panoramic Rocky Mountain peaks.": "\xD6zel k\xF6m\xFCrle\u015Ftirilmi\u015F sedir yap\u0131s\u0131, \u0131s\u0131tmal\u0131 a\xE7\u0131k hava arduvaz havuzlar\u0131 ve panoramik Rocky Mountain zirveleriyle piste do\u011Frudan eri\u015Fimli s\u0131\u011F\u0131nak.",
        "Ski-in chalet in old larch with a slate spa, fireplace lounge and a boot room that smells of pine.": "Eski kara\xE7amdan yap\u0131lm\u0131\u015F; arduvaz spas\u0131, \u015F\xF6mineli salonu ve \xE7am kokan bot odas\u0131yla kayakla girilen da\u011F evi.",
