        "Slow mornings, long walks, and a life measured in croissants and books.": "Yava\u015F sabahlar, uzun y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015Fler ve kruvasanlarla kitaplarla \xF6l\xE7\xFClen bir hayat.",
