        "Small enough to buy within days at your current pace (~D$ {pace}/day). The first purchase is the one that makes it real.": "Mevcut h\u0131z\u0131nla birka\xE7 g\xFCn i\xE7inde alabilece\u011Fin kadar eri\u015Filebilir (~D$ {pace}/g\xFCn). \u0130lk sat\u0131n alma, hayali ger\xE7ek k\u0131lan ad\u0131md\u0131r.",
