        "Solid walnut acoustic paneling, dual Pro Display XDRs, Genelec studio monitors, Herman Miller seating.": "Masif ceviz akustik kaplama, iki Pro Display XDR, Genelec st\xFCdyo monit\xF6rleri, Herman Miller koltuklar.",
