        "Ten days from neon to temples: omakase in Tokyo, gardens in Kyoto, one night in a ryokan.": "Neondan tap\u0131naklara on g\xFCn: Tokyo'da omakase, Kyoto'da bah\xE7eler, bir ryokan'da bir gece.",
        "Ten days with a private guide, tented camps, and elephants walking past your morning coffee.": "\xD6zel rehber, \xE7ad\u0131r kamplar ve sabah kahvenin yan\u0131ndan ge\xE7en fillerle on g\xFCn.",
        "Ten focused minutes now beats a perfect plan for tomorrow.": "\u015Eimdi odaklanarak ge\xE7irilen on dakika, yar\u0131n\u0131n kusursuz plan\u0131ndan iyidir.",
        "Ten minutes with your vision board before bed does more than an hour of worry.": "Yatmadan \xF6nce Vizyon Panonla ge\xE7irdi\u011Fin on dakika, bir saatlik kayg\u0131dan daha fazlas\u0131n\u0131 yapar.",
        "Ten years from now \u2014 if nothing changes": "Bundan on y\u0131l sonra \u2014 hi\xE7bir \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Fmezse",
        "Ten years on this default path \u2014 which doors have quietly closed for good?": "Bu varsay\u0131lan yolda on y\u0131l \u2014 hangi kap\u0131lar sessizce bir daha a\xE7\u0131lmamak \xFCzere kapand\u0131?",
        "Ten years. Look at your body. Look at your bank account. Look at the people who needed you to become someone. What do they see?": "On y\u0131l. Bedenine bak. Banka hesab\u0131na bak. Geli\u015Fmene ihtiya\xE7 duyan insanlara bak. Ne g\xF6r\xFCyorlar?",
        "Ten years. Look at your body. Your home. The people around you. This is what one decision a day builds.": "On y\u0131l. Bedenine bak. Evine. \xC7evrendeki insanlara. G\xFCnde bir karar\u0131n yaratt\u0131\u011F\u0131 hayat bu.",
        "Ten-course bespoke gastronomic dining journey orchestrated in your private dining room with rare vintage wine pairings.": "\xD6zel yemek odanda, nadir y\u0131llanm\u0131\u015F \u015Farap e\u015Fle\u015Fmeleriyle sunulan, sana \xF6zel on tabakl\u0131k gastronomi yolculu\u011Fu.",
        "Tender & Toys": "Servis Botu ve Su Oyuncaklar\u0131",
        "Tender Garage": "Servis Botu Garaj\u0131",
        "Tented Camp": "\xC7ad\u0131r Kamp\u0131",
        "Terrace Dining": "Terasta Yemek",
        "Terrace Views": "Teras Manzaralar\u0131",
        "Terraced Gardens": "Terasl\u0131 Bah\xE7eler",
        "Terracotta": "Terakota",
        "Tesla Model S Plaid": "Tesla Model S Plaid",
        "Test Alert": "Uyar\u0131y\u0131 Dene",
        "Test Cue": "Sesi Dene",
        "Test Drive the Life": "Bu Hayat\u0131 Dene",
        "Test Sound & Haptics": "Ses ve Titre\u015Fimi Dene",
        "Test a ski season rental in Verbier before buying.": "Sat\u0131n almadan \xF6nce Verbier'de bir kayak sezonu i\xE7in ev kiralayarak dene.",
        "Test drive McLaren 750S at a dedicated private track day.": "Sana \xF6zel bir pist g\xFCn\xFCnde McLaren 750S ile test s\xFCr\xFC\u015F\xFC yap.",
        "Test drive PHEV vs. V8 and choose.": "PHEV ile V8'i test s\xFCr\xFC\u015F\xFCnde kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r ve se\xE7.",
        "Test drive a classic before deciding on modern vs. vintage.": "Modern mi klasik mi alaca\u011F\u0131na karar vermeden \xF6nce klasik bir otomobili dene.",
        "Test drive it in Plaid mode with an empty road.": "Bo\u015F bir yolda Plaid modunda test s\xFCr\xFC\u015F\xFC yap.",
        "Test how the tab title blink and screen border pulse look when a session finishes.": "Bir seans bitti\u011Finde sekme ba\u015Fl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131p s\xF6nmesini ve ekran kenar\u0131ndaki \u0131\u015F\u0131k efektini dene.",
        "Test tactile tap chime": "Dokunma zilini dene",
        "Test the sailing life before buying the boat.": "Tekne almadan \xF6nce yelkenli ya\u015Fam\u0131n\u0131 dene.",
        "Test victory fanfare": "Zafer melodisini dene",
        "Test voice": "Sesi dene",
        "Testing\u2026": "Deneniyor\u2026",
        "That file is not a One Decision Away backup.": "Bu dosya bir One Decision Away yede\u011Fi de\u011Fil.",
        "The": "O",
        "The Built Future": "\u0130n\u015Fa Etti\u011Fin Gelecek",
        "The Cost of Drift": "S\xFCr\xFCklenmenin Bedeli",
        "The Default Future": "Ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na B\u0131rak\u0131lan Gelecek",
        "The Finisher": "Tamamlayan",
        "The Finisher Seal": "Tamamlayan M\xFChr\xFC",
        "The Future Life Score is an honest reflection tool. It does not measure your worth \u2014 it measures alignment with your stated ambitions.": "Gelecekteki Hayat Puan\u0131, kendine d\xFCr\xFCst\xE7e bakman\u0131 sa\u011Flayan bir ara\xE7t\u0131r. De\u011Ferini \xF6l\xE7mez \u2014 belirtti\u011Fin hedeflerle ne kadar uyumlu ilerledi\u011Fini \xF6l\xE7er.",
        "The Future You're Running From": "Ka\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131n Gelecek",
        "The Hamptons, New York": "The Hamptons, New York",
        "The Life Simulation Budget is a design blueprint to align your intentions with how you spend your energy, focus, and time.": "Ya\u015Fam Sim\xFClasyonu B\xFCt\xE7esi, niyetlerini enerjini, oda\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ve zaman\u0131n\u0131 nas\u0131l kulland\u0131\u011F\u0131nla uyumlu hale getiren bir tasar\u0131m plan\u0131d\u0131r.",
        "The Life You're Allowing": "\u0130zin Verdi\u011Fin Hayat",
        "The Life You're Building": "\u0130n\u015Fa Etti\u011Fin Hayat",
        "The Power of Daily Compounding Execution": "Her G\xFCn Birikerek B\xFCy\xFCyen Eylemin G\xFCc\xFC",
        "The Reality Bridge provides mathematical clarity for your physical life. It does not initiate real bank transactions.": "Ger\xE7eklik K\xF6pr\xFCs\xFC, ger\xE7ek ya\u015Fam\u0131na say\u0131larla netlik kazand\u0131r\u0131r. Ger\xE7ek banka i\u015Flemleri ba\u015Flatmaz.",
        "The Rolls that goes anywhere \u2014 an SUV with a picnic seat in the tailgate.": "Her yere giden Rolls \u2014 bagaj kapa\u011F\u0131nda piknik koltu\u011Fu olan bir SUV.",
        "The Story": "Hik\xE2ye",
        "The Two Futures Exercise": "\u0130ki Gelecek \xC7al\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131",
        "The Two Futures Walk": "\u0130ki Gelecek Y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015F\xFC",
        "The Verdi tuning; quiets mental noise and cortisol, and rebalances your natural rhythm.": "Verdi akordu; zihinsel g\xFCr\xFClt\xFCy\xFC ve kortizol\xFC sakinle\u015Ftirir, do\u011Fal ritmini yeniden dengeler.",
        "The Working Standard": "\xC7al\u0131\u015Fma Standard\u0131",
        "The ability to build my own business or travel for a month freely.": "Kendi i\u015Fimi kurabilmek ya da \xF6zg\xFCrce bir ay seyahat edebilmek.",
        "The absolute pinnacle of human aerodynamic physics and automotive speed.": "Aerodinamik m\xFChendisli\u011Finin ve otomobil h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131n zirvesi.",
        "The ceremony matters as much as the object.": "Rit\xFCel, nesnenin kendisi kadar \xF6nemlidir.",
        "The cost of an open loop is continuous subconscious friction.": "Yar\u0131m kalan bir i\u015Fin bedeli, bilin\xE7alt\u0131nda s\xFCrekli bir y\xFCk ta\u015F\u0131mand\u0131r.",
        "The daily reality you are actively working toward.": "Ula\u015Fmak i\xE7in emek verdi\u011Fin g\xFCndelik ya\u015Fam.",
        "The default future is built by accident. The built future is built before 10am.": "Ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n gelecek tesad\xFCfen \u015Fekillenir. \u0130n\u015Fa etti\u011Fin gelecek sabah 10'dan \xF6nce \u015Fekillenir.",
        "The desk is clearing. Feel the space appearing. Quiet. Clean. Ready.": "Masa bo\u015Fal\u0131yor. A\xE7\u0131lan alan\u0131 hisset. Sessiz. Temiz. Haz\u0131r.",
        "The dive watch that became the standard \u2014 300 m, ceramic bezel, Oystersteel.": "Standartlar\u0131 belirleyen dal\u0131\u015F saati \u2014 300 m, seramik \xE7er\xE7eve, Oystersteel.",
        "The doubt may return. That is fine. Now you know it is only a story, and you are the author.": "\u015E\xFCphe geri d\xF6nebilir. Sorun de\u011Fil. Art\u0131k bunun yaln\u0131zca bir hik\xE2ye oldu\u011Funu ve yazar\u0131n\u0131n sen oldu\u011Funu biliyorsun.",
        "The dream on your board is a few hundred good afternoons away. This is one of them.": "Panondaki hayale birka\xE7 y\xFCz verimli \xF6\u011Fleden sonra uzaktas\u0131n. Bu da onlardan biri.",
        "The environment does half the discipline for you.": "Do\u011Fru ortam, disiplinin yar\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 senin yerine sa\u011Flar.",
        "The environment you tolerate is the ceiling of what you will achieve.": "Katland\u0131\u011F\u0131n ortam, ba\u015Farabileceklerinin tavan\u0131n\u0131 belirler.",
        "The everyday supercar: flat-six, manual option, and a shape refined for sixty years.": "G\xFCnl\xFCk kullan\u0131ma uygun s\xFCper otomobil: boxer alt\u0131 silindir, manuel se\xE7enek ve altm\u0131\u015F y\u0131ld\u0131r geli\u015Fen bir tasar\u0131m.",
        "The first boat: a lesson in maintenance and joy.": "\u0130lk tekne: bak\u0131m ve keyif \xFCzerine bir ders.",
        "The first fifty bottles, chosen with a sommelier, laid down for the next decade.": "Bir sommelier ile se\xE7ilmi\u015F, gelecek on y\u0131l i\xE7in saklanan ilk elli \u015Fi\u015Fe.",
        "The first milestone piece.": "\u0130lk d\xF6n\xFCm noktan\u0131 simgeleyen par\xE7a.",
        "The first taste, sensibly priced.": "\u0130lk deneyim, makul bir fiyatla.",
        "The freedom to disappear in comfort.": "Konfor i\xE7inde g\xF6zden uzakla\u015Fma \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFC\u011F\xFC.",
        "The frequency of transformation and love; releases heaviness in the chest and opens gratitude.": "D\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCm\xFCn ve sevginin frekans\u0131; g\xF6\u011F\xFCsteki a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131 hafifletir ve \u015F\xFCkrana yer a\xE7ar.",
        "The friction you anticipate is almost always larger than the physical task itself.": "G\xF6z\xFCnde b\xFCy\xFCtt\xFC\u011F\xFCn zorluk, neredeyse her zaman i\u015Fin kendisinden daha b\xFCy\xFCkt\xFCr.",
        "The future belongs to those who believe in the beauty of their dreams and back it with unrelenting craft.": "Gelecek, hayallerinin g\xFCzelli\u011Fine inanan ve onlar\u0131 y\u0131lmadan emekle destekleyenlerindir.",
        "The future you're building is one good night's sleep closer.": "\u0130n\u015Fa etti\u011Fin gelece\u011Fe bir iyi gece uykusu daha yakla\u015Ft\u0131n.",
        "The future,": "Gelecek,",
        "The future, daily.": "Gelecek, her g\xFCn.",
        "The highest form of respect you can pay to {dName} is honoring the hours between now and its arrival with deep, undistracted craft.": "{dName} hayaline g\xF6sterebilece\u011Fin en b\xFCy\xFCk sayg\u0131, bug\xFCnden ger\xE7ekle\u015Fece\u011Fi ana kadar ge\xE7en saatleri derin ve kesintisiz bir emekle de\u011Ferlendirmektir.",
        "The hour when your daily focus checkpoint prompt appears.": "G\xFCnl\xFCk odak kontrol\xFC hat\u0131rlat\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n g\xF6r\xFCnece\u011Fi saat.",
        "The impediment to action advances action. What stands in the way becomes the way.": "Eylemin \xF6n\xFCndeki engel, eylemi ilerletir. Yolu kesen \u015Fey, yolun kendisi olur.",
        "The life you are building against the life you will live if nothing changes.": "\u0130n\u015Fa etti\u011Fin hayat ile hi\xE7bir \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Fmezse ya\u015Fayaca\u011F\u0131n hayat.",
        "The life you're allowing": "\u0130zin verdi\u011Fin hayat",
        "The life you're building": "\u0130n\u015Fa etti\u011Fin hayat",
        "The luxury SUV benchmark: air suspension, executive rear seats, and a presence that needs no badge.": "L\xFCks SUV \xF6l\xE7\xFCt\xFC: haval\u0131 s\xFCspansiyon, arka makam koltuklar\u0131 ve armaya ihtiya\xE7 duymayan bir duru\u015F.",
        "The market rewards specific knowledge, extreme reliability, and courage in negotiation.": "Piyasa, uzmanl\u0131k bilgisini, sars\u0131lmaz g\xFCvenilirli\u011Fi ve pazarl\u0131k cesaretini \xF6d\xFCllendirir.",
        "The mind is everything. What you think you become.": "Zihin her \u015Feydir. Ne d\xFC\u015F\xFCn\xFCrsen ona d\xF6n\xFC\u015F\xFCrs\xFCn.",
        "The mountains from above, in an hour.": "Bir saatte da\u011Flara yukar\u0131dan bak.",
        "The next single domino to set up tomorrow.": "Yar\u0131n devirmek \xFCzere haz\u0131rlayaca\u011F\u0131n bir sonraki domino ta\u015F\u0131.",
        "The one that stops traffic.": "Trafi\u011Fi durduran otomobil.",
        "The only person you are destined to become is the person you decide to be.": "Kaderinde olaca\u011F\u0131n tek ki\u015Fi, olmaya karar verdi\u011Fin ki\u015Fidir.",
        "The perfectionist procrastinator": "M\xFCkemmeliyet\xE7i erteleyici",
        "The person you're becoming shows up in the next hour. Let them.": "D\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFC\u011F\xFCn ki\u015Fi, \xF6n\xFCndeki bir saatte kendini g\xF6sterecek. Ona izin ver.",
        "The real price": "Ger\xE7ek bedeli",
        "The root frequency; releases buried anxiety, guilt and mental weight.": "K\xF6k frekans; bast\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015F kayg\u0131y\u0131, su\xE7lulu\u011Fu ve zihinsel y\xFCk\xFC hafifletir.",
        "The scroll will still be there. The momentum won't. Choose momentum.": "Ekran\u0131 kayd\u0131rmak sonra da m\xFCmk\xFCn. \u0130vmen beklemez. \u0130vmeni se\xE7.",
        "The sea as your living room.": "Deniz, oturma odan olsun.",
        "The secret of getting ahead is getting started.": "\u0130lerlemenin s\u0131rr\u0131, ba\u015Flamakt\u0131r.",
        "The shield": "Kalkan",
        "The speed of your transition to {dName} is strictly determined by the velocity of your daily decisions.": "{dName} hayaline ge\xE7i\u015F h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 do\u011Frudan g\xFCnl\xFCk kararlar\u0131n\u0131n h\u0131z\u0131 belirler.",
        "The streak is safe if you kept your word. If not, tomorrow is a clean page.": "S\xF6z\xFCn\xFC tuttuysan serin g\xFCvende. Tutmad\u0131ysan yar\u0131n temiz bir sayfa.",
        "The summer everyone remembers.": "Herkesin hat\u0131rlad\u0131\u011F\u0131 yaz.",
        "The trip you promised your partner years ago.": "Y\u0131llar \xF6nce partnerine s\xF6z verdi\u011Fin yolculuk.",
        "The ultimate expression of owning your time.": "Zaman\u0131n\u0131n sahibi olman\u0131n en g\xFC\xE7l\xFC ifadesi.",
        "The ultimate symbol of uncompromising mechanical mastery, driver connection, and discipline.": "Kusursuz mekanik ustal\u0131\u011F\u0131n, s\xFCr\xFC\u015Fle b\xFCt\xFCnle\u015Fmenin ve disiplinin en g\xFC\xE7l\xFC simgesi.",
        "The version that waits for perfect certainty before publishing.": "Payla\u015Fmadan \xF6nce kusursuz bir kesinlik bekleyen halin.",
        "Theatre": "Tiyatro",
        "There is no penalty for missed days \u2014 only the quiet math of where your days go.": "Ka\xE7\u0131r\u0131lan g\xFCnlerin cezas\u0131 yok \u2014 yaln\u0131zca g\xFCnlerini nereye harcad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131n sessiz hesab\u0131 var.",
        "Thermal Camper": "Is\u0131 Yal\u0131t\u0131ml\u0131 Karavan",
        "Thermal Suits": "Termal Giysiler",
        "Theta 6 Hz": "Teta 6 Hz",
        "Theta Waves": "Teta Dalgalar\u0131",
        "Think back over today. Find one thing you did well, even something small. Let yourself feel it.": "Bug\xFCn\xFC d\xFC\u015F\xFCn. K\xFC\xE7\xFCk de olsa iyi yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n bir \u015Fey bul. Bunun duygusunu ya\u015Famana izin ver.",
        "Think of a hard time that taught you something. Somehow it made you who you are. Thank it too.": "Sana bir \u015Fey \xF6\u011Freten zor bir zaman\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCn. Bir \u015Fekilde seni bug\xFCnk\xFC sen yapt\u0131. Ona da te\u015Fekk\xFCr et.",
        "Think of one meaningful thing you are building. A goal that actually matters to you.": "\u0130n\u015Fa etti\u011Fin anlaml\u0131 bir \u015Feyi d\xFC\u015F\xFCn. Senin i\xE7in ger\xE7ekten \xF6nemli olan bir hedefi.",
        "Think of one person who has helped you. See their face. Feel a warm thank you rise toward them.": "Sana yard\u0131m etmi\u015F birini d\xFC\u015F\xFCn. Y\xFCz\xFCn\xFC g\xF6z\xFCn\xFCn \xF6n\xFCne getir. Ona kar\u015F\u0131 i\xE7ten bir te\u015Fekk\xFCr\xFCn y\xFCkseldi\u011Fini hisset.",
        "Think of something in your home that makes your life easier. Something you rarely notice. Thank it.": "Evinde hayat\u0131n\u0131 kolayla\u015Ft\u0131ran bir \u015Feyi d\xFC\u015F\xFCn. Nadiren fark etti\u011Fin bir \u015Feyi. Ona te\u015Fekk\xFCr et.",
        "Think of the old self. The one who apologized for taking up space. Thank them, and let them go.": "Eski halini d\xFC\u015F\xFCn. Yer kaplad\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\xE7in \xF6z\xFCr dileyen o ki\u015Fiyi. Ona te\u015Fekk\xFCr et ve onu geride b\u0131rak.",
        "Think of the very next action. Not the whole project. The next fifteen minutes. See yourself starting.": "Hemen sonraki ad\u0131m\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCn. T\xFCm projeyi de\u011Fil. \xD6n\xFCndeki on be\u015F dakikay\u0131. Kendini ba\u015Flarken g\xF6r.",
        "Think of your body. Whatever it can do today, it is carrying you. Thank it for that.": "Bedenini d\xFC\u015F\xFCn. Bug\xFCn ne yapabiliyor olursa olsun, seni ta\u015F\u0131yor. Bunun i\xE7in ona te\u015Fekk\xFCr et.",
        "Thinking space, designed on purpose.": "\xD6zenle tasarlanm\u0131\u015F bir d\xFC\u015F\xFCnme alan\u0131.",
        "Thirty days in Kyoto and Tokyo ryokans, learning traditional craftsmanship, bullet train expeditions, and tea ceremonies.": "Kyoto ve Tokyo ryokanlar\u0131nda otuz g\xFCn; geleneksel zanaat \xF6\u011Frenimi, h\u0131zl\u0131 tren yolculuklar\u0131 ve \xE7ay seremonileri.",
        "This Month": "Bu Ay",
        "This Week, In 30 Seconds": "30 Saniyede Bu Hafta",
        "This file is packaged locally inside your browser and downloaded straight to your machine. No external servers or analytics track your backup.": "Bu dosya taray\u0131c\u0131nda yerel olarak haz\u0131rlan\u0131r ve do\u011Frudan cihaz\u0131na indirilir. Hi\xE7bir harici sunucu veya analiz sistemi yede\u011Fini izlemez.",
        "This is who you are now. Every choice today comes from this place.": "Art\u0131k sen busun. Bug\xFCnk\xFC her se\xE7imin buradan do\u011Fuyor.",
        "This mission was completed less than 2 hours ago. Your consistency is noted, but repeat rewards require spaced action.": "Bu g\xF6rev 2 saatten k\u0131sa s\xFCre \xF6nce tamamland\u0131. \u0130stikrar\u0131n de\u011Ferli, ancak tekrar \xF6d\xFClleri i\xE7in eylemler aras\u0131nda zaman olmal\u0131.",
        "This will permanently wipe your Dream Bank ledger, completed missions history, custom items, and Two Futures statements from your local device.": "Bu i\u015Flem, Hayal Bankas\u0131 hesap defterini, tamamlanan g\xF6rev ge\xE7mi\u015Fini, \xF6zel \xF6\u011Felerini ve \u0130ki Gelecek ifadelerini yerel cihaz\u0131ndan kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak siler.",
        "Thoughts may drift by. Let them go, like leaves on a slow river.": "D\xFC\u015F\xFCnceler gelip ge\xE7ebilir. Yava\u015F bir nehirdeki yapraklar gibi ak\u0131p gitmelerine izin ver.",
        "Three Cabins": "\xDC\xE7 Kamara",
        "Three Capitals": "\xDC\xE7 Ba\u015Fkent",
        "Three Days": "\xDC\xE7 G\xFCn",
        "Three Hours": "\xDC\xE7 Saat",
        "Three Nights": "\xDC\xE7 Gece",
        "Three Stars": "\xDC\xE7 Y\u0131ld\u0131z",
        "Three cabins, a flybridge, and enough range for the whole Mediterranean in one summer.": "\xDC\xE7 kamara, bir \xFCst kumanda g\xFCvertesi ve bir yazda t\xFCm Akdeniz'i gezmeye yetecek menzil.",
        "Three days of indoor pools looking into the forest, massages, sauna and food that fixes you.": "Ormana bakan kapal\u0131 havuzlar, masaj, sauna ve sana iyi gelen yemeklerle \xFC\xE7 g\xFCn.",
        "Three nights chasing the aurora with a photographer-guide and a thermal camper.": "Bir foto\u011Fraf\xE7\u0131 rehber ve \u0131s\u0131 yal\u0131t\u0131ml\u0131 karavanla kuzey \u0131\u015F\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131n pe\u015Finde \xFC\xE7 gece.",
        "Three nights over the marina, boats lit up below, brunch and a desert dune dinner.": "A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131da \u0131\u015F\u0131l \u0131\u015F\u0131l tekneleriyle marinaya bakan \xFC\xE7 gece, brunch ve \xE7\xF6l kumullar\u0131nda ak\u015Fam yeme\u011Fi.",
        "Three short, honest lines a day \u2014 one to start, one to re-aim, one to close. They arrive as notifications while the app is open or installed on your home screen. Never the same line twice in a day.": "G\xFCnde \xFC\xE7 k\u0131sa, i\xE7ten sat\u0131r \u2014 ba\u015Flamak, y\xF6n\xFCn\xFC yeniden bulmak ve g\xFCn\xFC kapatmak i\xE7in. Uygulama a\xE7\u0131kken veya ana ekran\u0131na y\xFCkl\xFCyken bildirim olarak gelirler. Ayn\u0131 sat\u0131r bir g\xFCnde iki kez g\xF6sterilmez.",
        "Three years from now \u2014 if nothing changes": "\xDC\xE7 y\u0131l sonra \u2014 hi\xE7bir \u015Fey de\u011Fi\u015Fmezse",
        "Three years. The work is real now. The money is calmer. Someone you respect just told you they are proud of you.": "\xDC\xE7 y\u0131l. \u0130\u015Fin art\u0131k somut. Para konusunda daha rahats\u0131n. Sayg\u0131 duydu\u011Fun biri az \xF6nce seninle gurur duydu\u011Funu s\xF6yledi.",
