        "Visit AP House for private horological demonstration.": "\xD6zel bir saat\xE7ilik g\xF6sterimi i\xE7in AP House'u ziyaret et.",
        "Visit Cabo's Pedregal and price the ocean-edge tier.": "Cabo'nun Pedregal b\xF6lgesini gez ve okyanus k\u0131y\u0131s\u0131ndaki m\xFClklerin fiyatlar\u0131n\u0131 ara\u015Ft\u0131r.",
        "Visit Copenhagen showrooms and note three design principles to copy.": "Kopenhag'daki sergi alanlar\u0131n\u0131 gez ve uygulamak istedi\u011Fin \xFC\xE7 tasar\u0131m ilkesini not al.",
        "Visit Italian lakeside properties and consult with European cross-border wealth advisory.": "\u0130talya'da g\xF6l k\u0131y\u0131s\u0131ndaki m\xFClkleri gez ve Avrupa'da s\u0131n\u0131r \xF6tesi servet dan\u0131\u015Fmanl\u0131\u011F\u0131 al.",
        "Visit Milan Design Week and pick the exact furniture line.": "Milano Tasar\u0131m Haftas\u0131'n\u0131 ziyaret et ve istedi\u011Fin mobilya serisini se\xE7.",
        "Visit Val d'Orcia in October and meet two restoration architects.": "Ekim ay\u0131nda Val d'Orcia'y\u0131 ziyaret et ve iki restorasyon mimar\u0131yla g\xF6r\xFC\u015F.",
        "Visit a classic Land Rover restorer.": "Klasik Land Rover restorasyonu yapan bir at\xF6lyeyi ziyaret et.",
        "Visit a manufacture in the Vall\xE9e de Joux.": "Vall\xE9e de Joux'da bir saat \xFCretim at\xF6lyesini ziyaret et.",
        "Visit lakeside architectural studios in Bellagio and structure European wealth portfolio.": "Bellagio'daki g\xF6l k\u0131y\u0131s\u0131 mimarl\u0131k ofislerini ziyaret et ve Avrupa yat\u0131r\u0131m portf\xF6y\xFCn\xFC yap\u0131land\u0131r.",
        "Visit official Ferrari atelier showroom for bespoke tailor-made specification review.": "Sana \xF6zel donan\u0131m se\xE7eneklerini incelemek i\xE7in resm\xEE Ferrari at\xF6lye sergi alan\u0131n\u0131 ziyaret et.",
        "Visit the life you refuse, then the one you choose": "\xD6nce istemedi\u011Fin hayata, sonra se\xE7ti\u011Fin hayata u\u011Fra",
        "Visit the showroom and configure it on paper.": "Sergi alan\u0131n\u0131 ziyaret et ve donan\u0131m\u0131 k\xE2\u011F\u0131t \xFCzerinde belirle.",
        "Visual Anchor (Optional Photo)": "G\xF6rsel Dayanak (\u0130ste\u011Fe Ba\u011Fl\u0131 Foto\u011Fraf)",
        "Visual Palace & Assets ({n})": "G\xF6rsel Saray ve Varl\u0131klar ({n})",
        "Visualize the physical details of your future milestone for 30 seconds.": "Gelecekteki d\xF6n\xFCm noktan\u0131n somut ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 30 saniye boyunca g\xF6z\xFCnde canland\u0131r.",
