        "Voices come from your operating system; quality varies by device.": "Sesler i\u015Fletim sisteminden gelir; kalite cihaza g\xF6re de\u011Fi\u015Fir.",
        "Vol. 01 \u2014 Edition": "Cilt 01 \u2014 Bask\u0131",
