        "Vote for Future": "Gelece\u011Fine Oy Ver",
        "Votes for The Built Future: {n}": "\u0130n\u015Fa Etti\u011Fin Gelece\u011Fe Verilen Oylar: {n}",
        "Votes for The Default Future: {n}": "Ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na B\u0131rak\u0131lan Gelece\u011Fe Verilen Oylar: {n}",
        "Waiting for ideal conditions is subtle procrastination. Excellence thrives within constraints.": "\u0130deal ko\u015Fullar\u0131 beklemek, gizli bir erteleme bi\xE7imidir. M\xFCkemmellik k\u0131s\u0131tlar i\xE7inde geli\u015Fir.",
        "Wake the fire and move": "\u0130\xE7indeki ate\u015Fi uyand\u0131r ve harekete ge\xE7",
        "Wake up rushed, commute with friction, do reactive tasks, return drained.": "Aceleyle uyan, i\u015Fe giderken zorlan, gelen i\u015Flere yeti\u015Fmeye \xE7al\u0131\u015F, bitkin d\xF6n.",
        "Wake up with a clear calendar, two hours of deep creation, afternoon training, evening reading.": "Sade bir takvimle uyan, iki saat derinlemesine \xFCret, \xF6\u011Fleden sonra antrenman yap, ak\u015Fam oku.",
        "Walk back through the door, bringing the feeling with you. Nothing is lost. It is all ahead.": "O duyguyu yan\u0131nda ta\u015F\u0131yarak kap\u0131dan geri d\xF6n. Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey kaybolmad\u0131. Hepsi \xF6n\xFCnde.",
        "Walk honestly through the default future first, feel its weight, then cross over into the life you are building. Ends with one decision.": "\xD6nce ak\u0131\u015F\u0131na b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011F\u0131n gelecekte d\xFCr\xFCst\xE7e y\xFCr\xFC, a\u011F\u0131rl\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 hisset, sonra in\u015Fa etti\u011Fin hayata ge\xE7. Tek bir kararla biter.",
        "Walk the Cornish coast path and shortlist three plots.": "Cornwall sahil yolunda y\xFCr\xFC ve \xFC\xE7 arsay\u0131 k\u0131sa listene al.",
        "Walking into the boutique to collect the watch you waited a year for.": "Bir y\u0131ld\u0131r bekledi\u011Fin saati almak i\xE7in buti\u011Fe giri\u015Fin.",
        "Wall-to-wall glass living room over the river and bridges, quiet study, and a rooftop terrace with a fire pit.": "Nehre ve k\xF6pr\xFClere bakan boydan boya caml\u0131 oturma odas\u0131, sessiz \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma odas\u0131 ve ate\u015F \xE7ukurlu \xE7at\u0131 teras\u0131.",
        "Warm 18k rose gold case with embossed brown dial, self-winding caliber 26-330 S C, and integrated satin-finished bracelet.": "Kabartmal\u0131 kahverengi kadran, otomatik kurmal\u0131 26-330 S C kalibre ve entegre saten finisajl\u0131 bilezikle s\u0131cak tonlu 18 ayar pembe alt\u0131n kasa.",
        "Warm 18k rose gold case, chocolate embossed horizontal dial, mechanical self-winding caliber 26-330 S C.": "S\u0131cak tonlu 18 ayar pembe alt\u0131n kasa, yatay kabartmal\u0131 \xE7ikolata renkli kadran, mekanik otomatik kurmal\u0131 26-330 S C kalibre.",
        "Warm Alabaster": "S\u0131cak Alabaster",
        "Warm Bronze": "S\u0131cak Bronz",
        "Warm Milanese apartment with cognac leather, brass details, parquet and tall shuttered windows over a courtyard.": "Konyak rengi deri, pirin\xE7 detaylar, parke ve avluya bakan uzun panjurlu pencerelerle s\u0131cak bir Milano dairesi.",
        "Warm Pool": "Il\u0131k Havuz",
        "Warm Solfeggio vitality bloom (528Hz + 660Hz)": "S\u0131cak Solfeggio canl\u0131l\u0131k dalgas\u0131 (528Hz + 660Hz)",
        "Warm brown strap, cream dial, the look of a watch your grandfather would respect.": "S\u0131cak kahverengi kay\u0131\u015F, krem kadran; b\xFCy\xFCkbaban\u0131n takdir edece\u011Fi bir saat g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm\xFC.",
        "Warm crackle": "S\u0131cak \xE7\u0131t\u0131rt\u0131",
        "Warm ivory paper canvas with high-contrast serif typography and refined hairline borders.": "Y\xFCksek kontrastl\u0131 serif yaz\u0131lar ve zarif ince \xE7izgili kenarl\u0131klarla s\u0131cak fildi\u015Fi k\xE2\u011F\u0131t zemin.",
        "Warm nights, cold pool, deep work.": "S\u0131cak geceler, serin havuz, derin \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma.",
        "Warm, human-like \xB7 needs API key": "S\u0131cak, insana yak\u0131n \xB7 API anahtar\u0131 gerekir",
        "Warming Up": "Is\u0131n\u0131yor",
        "Warmth flows down your arms, into your hands, all the way to your fingertips.": "S\u0131cakl\u0131k kollar\u0131ndan ellerine, oradan parmak u\xE7lar\u0131na kadar ak\u0131yor.",
        "Warmth, ease and a life that fits in sandals.": "S\u0131cakl\u0131k, rahatl\u0131k ve sandaletlerle ya\u015Fanan bir hayat.",
        "Waste no more time arguing about what a good person should be. Be one.": "\u0130yi bir insan\u0131n nas\u0131l olmas\u0131 gerekti\u011Fini tart\u0131\u015Farak daha fazla zaman kaybetme. \xD6yle biri ol.",
        "Watches": "Saatler",
        "We believe personal growth software should never use manipulative streaks, pay-to-win shortcuts, or disguised real-money gambling. Dream Dollars is strictly earned through real-world actions.": "Ki\u015Fisel geli\u015Fim yaz\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131n\u0131n manip\xFClatif seriler, parayla avantaj sa\u011Flayan kestirmeler veya gizlenmi\u015F ger\xE7ek paral\u0131 kumar kullanmamas\u0131 gerekti\u011Fine inan\u0131yoruz. Hayal Dolar\u0131 yaln\u0131zca ger\xE7ek d\xFCnyadaki eylemlerle kazan\u0131l\u0131r.",
        "We suffer more often in imagination than in reality.": "Ger\xE7ekte oldu\u011Fundan daha \xE7ok, hayalimizde ac\u0131 \xE7ekeriz.",
        "We'll ask for permission once.": "Bir kez izin isteyece\u011Fiz.",
        "We'll send a magic link \u2014 no password to remember.": "Bir giri\u015F ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131 g\xF6nderece\u011Fiz \u2014 hat\u0131rlaman gereken bir \u015Fifre yok.",
        "Wealth": "Varl\u0131k",
        "Wealth & Assets": "Varl\u0131k ve Birikim",
        "Wealth consists not in having great possessions, but in having few wants and abundant margin.": "Zenginlik, \xE7ok \u015Feye sahip olmak de\u011Fil, az \u015Feye ihtiya\xE7 duymak ve geni\u015F bir hareket alan\u0131na sahip olmakt\u0131r.",
        "Wealth is what you do not see: the freedom to refuse compromises, buy back your hours, and construct your own environment.": "Zenginlik g\xF6remedi\u011Fin \u015Feydir: tavizleri reddetme, zaman\u0131n\u0131 geri sat\u0131n alma ve kendi ortam\u0131n\u0131 kurma \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFC\u011F\xFC.",
        "Web Audio synthesis": "Web Audio sentezi",
        "Web Audio synthesizer output is disabled": "Web Audio sentezleyici \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F\u0131 kapal\u0131",
