        "Weekend review \u2014 no judgment, just the numbers.": "Hafta sonu de\u011Ferlendirmesi \u2014 yarg\u0131 yok, yaln\u0131zca say\u0131lar.",
        "Weekends that start Friday at noon.": "Cuma \xF6\u011Flen ba\u015Flayan hafta sonlar\u0131.",
        "Weekly": "Haftal\u0131k",
        "Weekly Completions": "Haftal\u0131k Tamamlananlar",
        "Weekly Consistency": "Haftal\u0131k \u0130stikrar",
        "Weekly Execution Rhythm": "Haftal\u0131k Eylem Ritmi",
        "Weekly Micro-Habit Trends": "Haftal\u0131k Mikro Al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131k E\u011Filimleri",
        "Weekly Mission (D$1,000)": "Haftal\u0131k G\xF6rev (D$1,000)",
        "Weekly Rollup": "Haftal\u0131k \xD6zet",
        "Weekly Two Futures Review": "Haftal\u0131k \u0130ki Gelecek De\u011Ferlendirmesi",
        "Weekly retrospective": "Haftal\u0131k de\u011Ferlendirme",
        "Weightless open-air speed and relentless pursuit of performance efficiency.": "A\xE7\u0131k havada hafifli\u011Fin h\u0131z\u0131 ve performans verimlili\u011Finin y\u0131lmaz aray\u0131\u015F\u0131.",
        "Weissach Motorsport Engineered": "Weissach Motorsport M\xFChendisli\u011Fi",
        "Weissach Package": "Weissach Paketi",
        "Welcome grant for beginning your journey": "Yolculu\u011Funa ba\u015Flama deste\u011Fi",
        "Welcome. Find a comfortable position, and let your eyes gently close.": "Ho\u015F geldin. Rahat bir pozisyon bul ve g\xF6zlerini yava\u015F\xE7a kapat.",
        "Welcome. Take a slow breath, and let the day soften.": "Ho\u015F geldin. Yava\u015F\xE7a nefes al ve g\xFCn\xFCn yumu\u015Famas\u0131na izin ver.",
        "Wellbeing & Joy": "\u0130yilik Hali ve Ne\u015Fe",
        "Wellness Retreat Weekend": "Hafta Sonu Yenilenme Molas\u0131",
        "What Avoidance Protects:": "Ka\xE7\u0131nman\u0131n Korudu\u011Fu \u015Eey:",
        "What Money Lets You Say No To:": "Paran\u0131n Hay\u0131r Demeni Sa\u011Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131 \u015Eeyler:",
        "What action did you take today? How did you overcome friction? What does this mean for your future life?": "Bug\xFCn hangi ad\u0131m\u0131 att\u0131n? Zorluklar\u0131 nas\u0131l a\u015Ft\u0131n? Bu, gelecekteki hayat\u0131n i\xE7in ne anlama geliyor?",
        "What are you known for, and by whom?": "Neyinle ve kimler taraf\u0131ndan tan\u0131n\u0131yorsun?",
        "What decision, vision moment, or realization happened?": "Hangi karar, vizyon an\u0131 veya fark\u0131ndal\u0131k ya\u015Fand\u0131?",
        "What dissatisfaction have you quietly agreed to live with?": "Hangi memnuniyetsizlikle ya\u015Famay\u0131 sessizce kabullendin?",
        "What do you complain about but never actually take action to change?": "Neyden \u015Fik\xE2yet ediyor ama de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmek i\xE7in hi\xE7 harekete ge\xE7miyorsun?",
        'What does financial autonomy let you say "no" to?': 'Maddi \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFCk nelere "hay\u0131r" demeni sa\u011Fl\u0131yor?',
        "What fear, discomfort, or judgment are your current avoidance habits protecting you from?": "Mevcut ka\xE7\u0131nma al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n seni hangi korkudan, rahats\u0131zl\u0131ktan veya yarg\u0131dan koruyor?",
        "What fueled your focus or caused friction today? (e.g. 7 hours uninterrupted sleep, box breathing session, deep work win)...": "Bug\xFCn oda\u011F\u0131n\u0131 ne besledi veya ne zorla\u015Ft\u0131rd\u0131? (\xF6r. 7 saat kesintisiz uyku, kutu nefesi \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmas\u0131, verimli bir derin \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma seans\u0131)...",
        "What happens if you change nothing for 5 to 10 years.": "5 ila 10 y\u0131l boyunca hi\xE7bir \u015Feyi de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmezsen ne olur.",
        "What is that protection actually costing you in time, dignity, and potential?": "Bu korunma sana zaman, \xF6zsayg\u0131 ve potansiyel a\xE7\u0131s\u0131ndan ger\xE7ekte neye mal oluyor?",
        "What is the first physical move that connects this dream to reality?": "Bu hayali ger\xE7e\u011Fe ba\u011Flayan ilk somut ad\u0131m nedir?",
        "What is the one decision that would make today meaningful?": "Bug\xFCn\xFC anlaml\u0131 k\u0131lacak tek karar ne?",
        "What makes today meaningful:": "Bug\xFCn\xFC anlaml\u0131 k\u0131lan:",
        "What we achieve inwardly will change outer reality.": "\u0130\xE7imizde ba\u015Fard\u0131klar\u0131m\u0131z, d\u0131\u015F ger\xE7ekli\u011Fi de\u011Fi\u015Ftirir.",
        "Whatever came, hold it. That is your instruction for today.": "Akl\u0131na ne geldiyse tut. Bug\xFCn i\xE7in yol g\xF6stericin o.",
        "Whatever you avoided yesterday is the One Decision for today.": "D\xFCn ka\xE7\u0131nd\u0131\u011F\u0131n \u015Fey, bug\xFCn\xFCn Tek Karar\u0131.",
        "When you voluntarily embrace physical effort, modern mental stress loses its power over your nervous system.": "Fiziksel \xE7abay\u0131 isteyerek kucaklad\u0131\u011F\u0131nda, g\xFCn\xFCm\xFCz\xFCn zihinsel stresi sinir sistemin \xFCzerindeki g\xFCc\xFCn\xFC kaybeder.",
        "When your emotional anchor to your future life is vivid, momentary discomfort fades.": "Gelecekteki hayat\u0131na duygusal ba\u011F\u0131n canl\u0131 oldu\u011Funda, anl\u0131k rahats\u0131zl\u0131klar solukla\u015F\u0131r.",
        "When your inner identity is anchored in {futureRole}, the physical manifestation of {dName} is merely a matter of time and calm persistence.": "\u0130\xE7sel kimli\u011Fin {futureRole} rol\xFCne k\xF6k sald\u0131\u011F\u0131nda, {dName} hayalinin ger\xE7e\u011Fe d\xF6n\xFC\u015Fmesi yaln\u0131zca zaman ve sakin bir kararl\u0131l\u0131k meselesidir.",
        "Where you place your gaze determines the emotional tone and trajectory of your day.": "Bak\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131 nereye \xE7evirdi\u011Fin, g\xFCn\xFCn\xFCn duygusal tonunu ve y\xF6n\xFCn\xFC belirler.",
        "Which doors are closed for good? Who did you become to the people who depend on you? What is the one sentence you would say about the last decade?": "Hangi kap\u0131lar sonsuza dek kapand\u0131? Sana g\xFCvenen insanlar i\xE7in nas\u0131l biri oldun? Ge\xE7en on y\u0131l hakk\u0131nda s\xF6yleyece\u011Fin tek c\xFCmle ne olurdu?",
        "Which opportunities did you watch other people take? What does your body feel like? What do you tell yourself at 11pm?": "Ba\u015Fkalar\u0131n\u0131n hangi f\u0131rsatlar\u0131 de\u011Ferlendirmesini izledin? Bedenin nas\u0131l hissediyor? Saat 23.00'te kendine ne s\xF6yl\xFCyorsun?",
        "Which outdated version of yourself would you need to let go of to change?": "De\u011Fi\u015Fmek i\xE7in kendinin hangi eski halini geride b\u0131rakman gerekiyor?",
        "White Beach Houses Behind the Dunes": "Kumullar\u0131n Ard\u0131ndaki Beyaz Sahil Evleri",
        "White Cube Villa": "Beyaz K\xFCp Villa",
        "White desk under a big window, one monitor, one plant, one purpose.": "B\xFCy\xFCk bir pencerenin alt\u0131nda beyaz masa, bir monit\xF6r, bir bitki, bir ama\xE7.",
        "White-walled, art-first apartment with oak floors, a sculptural kitchen and a north-facing light that never glares.": "Me\u015Fe zeminleri, heykelsi mutfa\u011F\u0131 ve g\xF6z almayan kuzey \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131yla beyaz duvarl\u0131, sanat\u0131 oda\u011F\u0131na alan daire.",
        "Whitewashed Stone": "Beyaz Badanal\u0131 Ta\u015F",
        "Who is around you, and how do you show up for them?": "\xC7evrende kimler var ve onlar\u0131n yan\u0131nda nas\u0131l yer al\u0131yorsun?",
        "Why Do You Want This Dream?": "Bu Hayali Neden \u0130stiyorsun?",
        "Why Do You Want This? (Your Emotional Anchor)": "Bunu Neden \u0130stiyorsun? (Duygusal Dayana\u011F\u0131n)",
        "Why This Matters / Core Vision (Optional)": "Bu Neden \xD6nemli / Temel Vizyon (\u0130ste\u011Fe Ba\u011Fl\u0131)",
        "Wide Porch": "Geni\u015F Veranda",
        "Wild Garden": "Do\u011Fal Bah\xE7e",
        "Window Light": "Pencere I\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131",
        "Wine Cellar": "\u015Earap Mahzeni",
        "Wine Pairing": "\u015Earap E\u015Fle\u015Fmesi",
        "Wine Wall": "\u015Earap Duvar\u0131",
        "Winter as a season to look forward to, not survive.": "Atlat\u0131lmas\u0131 gereken de\u011Fil, sab\u0131rs\u0131zl\u0131kla beklenen bir mevsim olarak k\u0131\u015F.",
        "Winter weekends without the transfer.": "Transfer zahmeti olmadan k\u0131\u015F hafta sonlar\u0131.",
        "Wisdom Delivery Time": "Bilgelik Bildirimi Saati",
        "With the Winemaker": "\u015Earap \xDCreticisiyle",
        "Wk {n} ({from} - {to})": "{n}. Hf ({from} - {to})",
        "Woke up at 6:00 AM without hitting snooze. Sat in quiet stillness with black coffee before looking at any screens. Visualized walking into the morning light of the waterfront villa\u2014felt the standard of the day elevate immediately.": "Erteleme tu\u015Funa basmadan sabah 6.00'da uyand\u0131m. Ekranlara bakmadan \xF6nce sade kahvemle sessizlikte oturdum. Sahildeki villan\u0131n sabah \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131na y\xFCr\xFCd\xFC\u011F\xFCm\xFC hayal ettim\u2014g\xFCn\xFCn standard\u0131n\u0131n an\u0131nda y\xFCkseldi\u011Fini hissettim.",
        "Woking, United Kingdom": "Woking, United Kingdom",
        "Wonder \u2014 the feeling that makes everything else feel small.": "Hayranl\u0131k \u2014 di\u011Fer her \u015Feyi k\xFC\xE7\xFCk hissettiren duygu.",
        "Wood Sauna": "Ah\u015Fap Sauna",
        "Wood Stove": "Odun Sobas\u0131",
        "Wooden cabin on a still lake ringed by forest, wide porch, canoe, and a screened room for summer nights.": "Ormanla \xE7evrili durgun bir g\xF6lde ah\u015Fap kul\xFCbe, geni\u015F veranda, kano ve yaz geceleri i\xE7in sineklikli oda.",
        "Work & Enterprise": "\u0130\u015F ve Giri\u015Fim",
        "Work & Purpose": "\u0130\u015F ve Ama\xE7",
        "Workspace": "\xC7al\u0131\u015Fma Alan\u0131",
        "Workstation and hardware": "\xC7al\u0131\u015Fma istasyonu ve donan\u0131m",
        "Write high-impact product proposition and strategic roadmap": "G\xFC\xE7l\xFC bir \xFCr\xFCn de\u011Fer \xF6nerisi ve stratejik yol haritas\u0131 yaz",
        "Write it": "Yaz",
        "Write one line in the journal: what did today teach you?": "G\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFCne bir sat\u0131r yaz: bug\xFCn sana ne \xF6\u011Fretti?",
        "Write your honest observation here...": "\u0130\xE7ten g\xF6zlemini buraya yaz...",
        "Writer's Cabin in the Woods": "Ormanda Yazar Kul\xFCbesi",
        "Writing & Clarity": "Yazma ve Netlik",
        "Writing & Reflection": "Yazma ve D\xFC\u015F\xFCnme",
        "Written from ten years down the default path. Read it when you feel the pull to postpone.": "Hi\xE7bir \u015Feyi de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmedi\u011Fin yolun on y\u0131l ilerisinden yaz\u0131ld\u0131. Erteleme iste\u011Fi duydu\u011Funda oku.",
        "Yacht Afternoon": "Yatta \xD6\u011Fleden Sonra",
        "Yachts & Jets": "Yatlar ve Jetler",
        "Yearly ($49 / yr \xB7 Save 42%)": "Y\u0131ll\u0131k ($49 / y\u0131l \xB7 %42 Tasarruf)",
        "Years of postponement and staying in a comfortable plateau.": "Y\u0131llarca ertelemek ve konforlu bir dura\u011Fanl\u0131kta kalmak.",
        "Yellow Gold": "Sar\u0131 Alt\u0131n",
        "Yes, Delete": "Evet, Sil",
        "Yes, Reset Everything": "Evet, Her \u015Eeyi S\u0131f\u0131rla",
        "Yest.": "D\xFCn",
        "Yoga Deck": "Yoga Teras\u0131",
        "You already own this dream in My Future Life": "Gelecekteki Hayat\u0131m'da bu hayale zaten sahipsin",
        "You are allowed to be proud of a small day.": "Sakin ge\xE7en bir g\xFCnle de gurur duyabilirsin.",
        "You are always exactly one decisive choice away from an entirely different standard of living.": "Bamba\u015Fka bir ya\u015Fam standard\u0131na her zaman yaln\u0131zca tek bir kararl\u0131 se\xE7im uzaktas\u0131n.",
        "You are not merely wishing for {dName}; you are cultivating the caliber of mind and standard of execution that makes it inevitable.": "Yaln\u0131zca {dName} dilemiyorsun; onu ka\xE7\u0131n\u0131lmaz k\u0131lan d\xFC\u015F\xFCnce niteli\u011Fini ve eylem standard\u0131n\u0131 geli\u015Ftiriyorsun.",
        "You are safe. You are calm. You are allowed to rest.": "G\xFCvendesin. Sakinsin. Dinlenebilirsin.",
        "You are safe. You are warm. You are done for today.": "G\xFCvendesin. \u0130\xE7in s\u0131cak. Bug\xFCnl\xFCk i\u015Fin bitti.",
        "You can already afford this. Today is the day you go and get it.": "Buna zaten g\xFCc\xFCn yetiyor. Bug\xFCn gidip onu alaca\u011F\u0131n g\xFCn.",
        "You carry this feeling. It is not outside you. It never was.": "Bu duyguyu i\xE7inde ta\u015F\u0131yorsun. D\u0131\u015F\u0131nda de\u011Fil. Hi\xE7 olmad\u0131.",
        "You did enough. Rest is part of the system, not a break from it.": "Yeterince yapt\u0131n. Dinlenmek sistemin bir par\xE7as\u0131, sistemden uzakla\u015Fmak de\u011Fil.",
        "You did not wish for this. You earned it, one decision at a time.": "Bunu dilemedin. Her seferinde bir kararla kazand\u0131n.",
        "You do not have to act on the urge. Watch it rise, like a wave. Watch it fall. It always falls.": "D\xFCrt\xFCye g\xF6re hareket etmek zorunda de\u011Filsin. Bir dalga gibi y\xFCkseli\u015Fini izle. \u0130ni\u015Fini izle. Her zaman iner.",
        "You do not have to conquer the entire mountain today\u2014only take the next deliberate step with the presence of one who knows they will arrive at {dName}.": "Bug\xFCn b\xFCt\xFCn da\u011F\u0131 a\u015Fmak zorunda de\u011Filsin\u2014yaln\u0131zca {dName} hedefine varaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bilen birinin fark\u0131ndal\u0131\u011F\u0131yla s\u0131radaki bilin\xE7li ad\u0131m\u0131 at.",
        "You do not rise to the level of your financial hopes; you fall to the discipline of your daily margin.": "Maddi umutlar\u0131n\u0131n seviyesine y\xFCkselmezsin; g\xFCnl\xFCk birikim disiplininin seviyesine inersin.",
        "You do not rise to the level of your goals. You fall to the level of your systems.": "Hedeflerinin seviyesine y\xFCkselmezsin. Sistemlerinin seviyesine inersin.",
        "You don't have to finish. You have to continue.": "Bitirmek zorunda de\u011Filsin. Devam etmen gerekiyor.",
        "You don't need motivation. You need the first two minutes. Start there.": "Motivasyona ihtiyac\u0131n yok. \u0130lk iki dakikaya ihtiyac\u0131n var. Oradan ba\u015Fla.",
        "You have attained this milestone in real life or completed its full simulation cycle.": "Bu d\xF6n\xFCm noktas\u0131na ger\xE7ek hayatta ula\u015Ft\u0131n veya sim\xFClasyon d\xF6ng\xFCs\xFCn\xFC tamamen bitirdin.",
        "You have completed {n} minutes of focus. Ending now will release the app lock without logging a verified completion.": "{n} dakikal\u0131k odaklanmay\u0131 tamamlad\u0131n. \u015Eimdi bitirirsen do\u011Frulanm\u0131\u015F bir tamamlama kayd\u0131 olu\u015Fturmadan uygulama kilidi a\xE7\u0131l\u0131r.",
        "You have kept your word before. Do it again, quietly, this morning.": "Daha \xF6nce s\xF6z\xFCn\xFC tuttun. Bu sabah, sessizce bir kez daha tut.",
        "You have never made a backup.": "Hen\xFCz hi\xE7 yedek olu\u015Fturmad\u0131n.",
        "You have not completed any missions under this filter yet.": "Bu filtrede hen\xFCz hi\xE7bir g\xF6rev tamamlamad\u0131n.",
        "You haven't answered the eight \"life you're allowing\" questions yet.": '"\u0130zin verdi\u011Fin hayat" hakk\u0131ndaki sekiz soruyu hen\xFCz yan\u0131tlamad\u0131n.',
        "You haven't set today's One Decision yet.": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn Tek Karar\u0131n\u0131 hen\xFCz belirlemedin.",
        "You held the standard for {n} minutes of deep craftsmanship.": "{n} dakika boyunca derinlemesine \xE7al\u0131\u015Farak standard\u0131n\u0131 korudun.",
        "You need D$ {n} more.": "D$ {n} daha gerekiyor.",
        "You're one decision away. Not someday \u2014 today.": "Bir karar uzaktas\u0131n. Bir g\xFCn de\u011Fil \u2014 bug\xFCn.",
        "You've reached today's 5 paid daily quests. Mission completed and recorded toward your Future Life!": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn 5 \xF6d\xFCll\xFC g\xFCnl\xFCk g\xF6revine ula\u015Ft\u0131n. G\xF6rev tamamland\u0131 ve Gelecekteki Hayat\u0131na kaydedildi!",
        "Your Custom Categories": "\xD6zel Kategorilerin",
        "Your First Concrete Real-World Step": "Ger\xE7ek D\xFCnyadaki \u0130lk Somut Ad\u0131m\u0131n",
        "Your Future Life Gallery is Empty": "Gelecekteki Hayat Galerin Bo\u015F",
        "Your Future Life Score is {score}/100. Your current actions are not yet supporting the future you described. That is information, not a verdict \u2014 and it is exactly what this app is for.": "Gelecekteki Hayat Puan\u0131n {score}/100. Mevcut eylemlerin, tarif etti\u011Fin gelece\u011Fi hen\xFCz desteklemiyor. Bu bir bilgi, h\xFCk\xFCm de\u011Fil \u2014 ve bu uygulama tam da bunun i\xE7in var.",
        "Your Future Self ({futureRole}) has already overcome today's micro-resistances.": "Gelecekteki Benli\u011Fin ({futureRole}), bug\xFCn\xFCn k\xFC\xE7\xFCk diren\xE7lerini \xE7oktan a\u015Ft\u0131.",
        "Your Two Futures Compass": "\u0130ki Gelecek Pusulan",
        "Your Vision Board Is Empty": "Vizyon Panon Bo\u015F",
        "Your anchor execution pillar. Pair developing routines directly after these habits for seamless habit stacking.": "Temel eylem dayana\u011F\u0131n. Al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 kolayca birbirine ba\u011Flamak i\xE7in geli\u015Ftirmek istedi\u011Fin rutinleri bu al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131klar\u0131n hemen arkas\u0131na ekle.",
        "Your brain has been trained to expect a reward every few seconds. Right now, you are retraining it.": "Beynin birka\xE7 saniyede bir \xF6d\xFCl beklemeye al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131. \u015Eu anda onu yeniden e\u011Fitiyorsun.",
        "Your breath is slow and deep, like waves rolling onto a quiet shore.": "Nefesin, sakin bir k\u0131y\u0131ya vuran dalgalar gibi yava\u015F ve derin.",
        "Your chest rises and falls on its own. Each exhale lets the body sink a little deeper.": "G\xF6\u011Fs\xFCn kendi kendine y\xFCkselip al\xE7al\u0131yor. Her nefes veri\u015Fte bedenin biraz daha gev\u015Fiyor.",
        "Your current actions are largely supporting the future you want. The work now is protecting what works.": "Mevcut eylemlerin, istedi\u011Fin gelece\u011Fi b\xFCy\xFCk \xF6l\xE7\xFCde destekliyor. \u015Eimdi g\xF6rev, i\u015Fe yarayanlar\u0131 korumak.",
        "Your data lives only in this browser.": "Verilerin yaln\u0131zca bu taray\u0131c\u0131da saklan\u0131r.",
        "Your dominant internal monologue sculpts your physical perception and choices.": "Bask\u0131n i\xE7 sesin, d\xFCnyay\u0131 alg\u0131lay\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131 ve se\xE7imlerini \u015Fekillendirir.",
        "Your emotional anchor and future-self standard.": "Duygusal dayana\u011F\u0131n ve gelecekteki benlik standard\u0131n.",
        "Your external life is a trailing indicator of your internal standards and beliefs.": "D\u0131\u015F d\xFCnyadaki hayat\u0131n, i\xE7sel standartlar\u0131n\u0131n ve inan\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131n gecikmeli bir g\xF6stergesidir.",
        "Your future is not decided by grand once-a-year resolutions, but by the private standards you uphold when nobody is watching.": "Gelece\u011Fini y\u0131lda bir al\u0131nan b\xFCy\xFCk kararlar de\u011Fil, kimse bakm\u0131yorken korudu\u011Fun ki\u015Fisel standartlar belirler.",
        "Your future is not forged in occasional marathons\u2014it is constructed by making and executing exactly": "Gelece\u011Fin, ara s\u0131ra ko\u015Fulan maratonlarla de\u011Fil, her g\xFCn kararl\u0131 ad\u0131mlar atarak in\u015Fa edilir:",
        "Your future self is already awake. Give them one thing to be proud of by tonight.": "Gelecekteki benli\u011Fin \xE7oktan uyand\u0131. Bu ak\u015Fama kadar ona gurur duyaca\u011F\u0131 bir \u015Fey ver.",
        "Your future self is watching this exact moment. Every hour you waste, they lose. Every hour you invest, they win.": "Gelecekteki benli\u011Fin tam \u015Fu an\u0131 izliyor. Bo\u015Fa harcad\u0131\u011F\u0131n her saatte o kaybediyor. Yat\u0131r\u0131m yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n her saatte o kazan\u0131yor.",
        "Your highest output area currently.": "\u015Eu anda en \xE7ok \xFCretti\u011Fin alan.",
        "Your highest-momentum life domain this week is": "Bu hafta en \xE7ok ivme kazand\u0131\u011F\u0131n ya\u015Fam alan\u0131",
        "Your immutable ledger of symbolic earnings, marketplace expenditures, and savings momentum.": "Sembolik kazan\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131n, pazar harcamalar\u0131n\u0131n ve birikim ivmenin de\u011Fi\u015Ftirilemez hesap defteri.",
        "Your legs are heavy. Your feet are warm. The whole body is sinking, safe and supported.": "Bacaklar\u0131n a\u011F\u0131r. Ayaklar\u0131n s\u0131cak. T\xFCm bedenin gev\u015Fiyor, g\xFCvende ve desteklenmi\u015F hissediyor.",
        "Your life data, journal reflections, Dream Bank ledger, and Two Futures statements are stored locally on your device. Export a complete JSON backup at any time.": "Ya\u015Fam verilerin, g\xFCnl\xFCk yaz\u0131lar\u0131n, Hayal Bankas\u0131 hesap defterin ve \u0130ki Gelecek ifadelerin cihaz\u0131nda yerel olarak saklan\u0131r. \u0130stedi\u011Fin zaman tam bir JSON yede\u011Fi d\u0131\u015Fa aktar.",
        "Your past does not define your trajectory. Today's decisions rewrite your identity.": "Ge\xE7mi\u015Fin gidi\u015Fat\u0131n\u0131 belirlemez. Bug\xFCnk\xFC kararlar\u0131n kimli\u011Fini yeniden yazar.",
        "Your priorities and personal vision have matured beyond this specific item.": "\xD6nceliklerin ve ki\u015Fisel vizyonun bu \xF6\u011Fenin \xF6tesine ge\xE7ti.",
        "Your shoulders melt into the surface beneath you. Your arms are heavy. Your hands are warm.": "Omuzlar\u0131n alt\u0131ndaki y\xFCzeye b\u0131rak\u0131yor kendini. Kollar\u0131n a\u011F\u0131r. Ellerin s\u0131cak.",
        "Your streak doesn't care how you feel. It cares what you do next.": "Serin nas\u0131l hissetti\u011Fine bakmaz. S\u0131radaki ad\u0131m\u0131na bakar.",
        "Your time is limited, so don't waste it living someone else's life.": "Zaman\u0131n s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131, bu y\xFCzden onu ba\u015Fkas\u0131n\u0131n hayat\u0131n\u0131 ya\u015Fayarak harcama.",
        "Your vision is now drafted. Continue into Life OS to set your daily One Decision, earn Dream Dollars, and build your future world step by step.": "Vizyonunun tasla\u011F\u0131 haz\u0131r. G\xFCnl\xFCk Tek Karar\u0131n\u0131 belirlemek, Hayal Dolar\u0131 kazanmak ve gelecekteki d\xFCnyan\u0131 ad\u0131m ad\u0131m kurmak i\xE7in Ya\u015Fam OS'e ge\xE7.",
        "Your voice, published weekly.": "Sesin, her hafta yay\u0131nda.",
        "Your whole life OS lives in this browser. Download a backup regularly, and sign in to sync it across your phone and laptop.": "T\xFCm ya\u015Fam sistemin bu taray\u0131c\u0131da saklan\u0131r. D\xFCzenli olarak yedek indir; telefonunla bilgisayar\u0131n aras\u0131nda e\u015Fitlemek i\xE7in giri\u015F yap.",
        "Your willpower, decision stamina, and creative audacity are direct outputs of deep sleep, clean cellular hydration, and circadian alignment.": "\u0130raden, karar verme dayan\u0131kl\u0131l\u0131\u011F\u0131n ve yarat\u0131c\u0131 cesaretin; derin uykunun, yeterli su t\xFCketiminin ve biyolojik ritimle uyumun do\u011Frudan sonucudur.",
        "Yours.": "Senin.",
        "Zen Gong": "Zen Gongu",
        "Zen temple": "Zen tap\u0131na\u011F\u0131",
        "Zephyr \u2014 bright, gentle": "Zephyr \u2014 ayd\u0131nl\u0131k, nazik",
        "Zermatt Matterhorn Retreat": "Zermatt Matterhorn \u0130nzivas\u0131",
        "Zermatt, Switzerland": "Zermatt, Switzerland",
        "Zermatt, Switzerland & Monte Rosa": "Zermatt, Switzerland & Monte Rosa",
        "Zero Interruptions": "S\u0131f\u0131r Kesinti",
        "Zero Reactive Phone Check (First 30m)": "G\xFCne Telefona Bakmadan Ba\u015Fla (\u0130lk 30 dk)",
        "Zero currency generated on this date.": "Bu tarihte hi\xE7 para kazan\u0131lmad\u0131.",
        "Zero social media consumption before 12:00 PM standard": "\xD6\u011Flen 12.00'den \xF6nce hi\xE7 sosyal medya t\xFCketmeme standard\u0131",
        "Zero to sixty in two seconds, silent, and it updates itself overnight.": "S\u0131f\u0131rdan altm\u0131\u015F mile iki saniyede, sessizce; \xFCstelik gece kendi kendini g\xFCncelliyor.",
        "Zero-Edge Pool": "S\u0131f\u0131r Kenarl\u0131 Havuz",
        "Zero-friction private aviation travel with bespoke lie-flat leather suites, high-altitude connectivity, and VIP ramp departure.": "Sana \xF6zel tam yatabilen deri s\xFCitler, y\xFCksek irtifada ba\u011Flant\u0131 ve VIP aprondan kalk\u0131\u015Fla zahmetsiz \xF6zel havac\u0131l\u0131k seyahati.",
        "Zoom & Inspect Details": "Yak\u0131nla\u015Ft\u0131r ve Ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131 \u0130ncele",
        "a decade": "on y\u0131l",
        "a year,": "bir y\u0131l,",
        "accelerating": "h\u0131zlan\u0131yor",
        "achieved /": "tamamland\u0131 /",
        "across {n} days. To eliminate friction in lower-frequency categories, attach a 2-minute version of that action immediately after completing your daily {label} routine.": "{n} g\xFCnde. Daha seyrek yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n kategorilerde zorlanmay\u0131 azaltmak i\xE7in, o eylemin 2 dakikal\u0131k bir s\xFCr\xFCm\xFCn\xFC g\xFCnl\xFCk {label} rutinini tamamlad\u0131ktan hemen sonra ekle.",
        "active micro-habit definitions": "aktif mikro al\u0131\u015Fkanl\u0131k tan\u0131mlar\u0131",
        "add them to your Dream Market": "onlar\u0131 Hayal Pazar\u0131na ekle",
        "affordable now": "\u015Fimdi al\u0131nabilir",
        "and": "ve",
        "anon public key": "anon genel anahtar\u0131",
        "archived": "ar\u015Fivlendi",
