        "Not connected to a cloud project yet. To enable sync, create a free Supabase project, run {schema}, and paste the project URL and anon key here (or set {url} / {key} at build time).": "Hen\xFCz bir bulut projesine ba\u011Fl\u0131 de\u011Filsin. E\u015Fitlemeyi etkinle\u015Ftirmek i\xE7in \xFCcretsiz bir Supabase projesi olu\u015Ftur, {schema} dosyas\u0131n\u0131 \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r ve projenin URL adresini ve anon anahtar\u0131n\u0131 buraya yap\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r (veya derleme s\u0131ras\u0131nda {url} / {key} de\u011Fi\u015Fkenlerini ayarla).",
