        "Take your parents on the trip they always mention": "Ailenle her zaman bahsettikleri geziye \xE7\u0131k",
        "The place they talk about, planned around their pace, with time for long meals and slow walks.": "S\xFCrekli konu\u015Ftuklar\u0131 o yer; onlar\u0131n h\u0131z\u0131nda planlanm\u0131\u015F, uzun yemeklere ve a\u011F\u0131r y\xFCr\xFCy\xFC\u015Flere zaman ayr\u0131lm\u0131\u015F.",
