        "Few gifts change daily life as directly as clean water.": "Az say\u0131da ba\u011F\u0131\u015F, temiz su kadar do\u011Frudan bir g\xFCnl\xFCk hayat\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftirir.",
        "Compare two charities\u2019 reports and pledge a first amount.": "\u0130ki kurulu\u015Fun raporlar\u0131n\u0131 kar\u015F\u0131la\u015Ft\u0131r ve ilk ba\u011F\u0131\u015F\u0131n\u0131 yap.",
