        "Two hours a week at a community garden, food bank or shelter, for three months.": "\xDC\xE7 ay boyunca haftada iki saat, bir topluluk bah\xE7esinde, g\u0131da bankas\u0131nda ya da bar\u0131nakta.",
        "Being useful to others is one of the surest roads to feeling well.": "Ba\u015Fkalar\u0131na faydal\u0131 olmak, iyi hissetmenin en g\xFCvenli yollar\u0131ndan biri.",
        "Email one local organisation and ask how to start.": "Yerel bir kurulu\u015Fa e-posta at ve nas\u0131l ba\u015Flayabilece\u011Fini sor.",
        "Two hours a week": "Haftada iki saat",
        "Three months": "\xDC\xE7 ay",
        "Local community": "Yerel topluluk",
        "Open your own small business": "Kendi k\xFC\xE7\xFCk i\u015Fini kur",
        "From idea to first 100 customers: test small, learn fast, then open the doors.": "Fikirden ilk 100 m\xFC\u015Fteriye: k\xFC\xE7\xFCk dene, h\u0131zl\u0131 \xF6\u011Fren, sonra kap\u0131lar\u0131 a\xE7.",
