        "Changed next:": "Sonraki de\u011Fi\u015Fiklik:",
        "Family & Friends": "Aile ve Arkada\u015Flar",
        "Education": "E\u011Fitim",
        "Health & Wellness": "Sa\u011Fl\u0131k ve Zindelik",
        "Business": "\u0130\u015F",
        "~1 day": "~1 g\xFCn",
        "{count} scientific publications were reviewed before the lessons were written, alongside official health guidance. Findings were adapted into original daily exercises. ODA courses themselves have not been clinically tested; they are for education and personal practice.": "Dersler yaz\u0131lmadan \xF6nce {count} bilimsel yay\u0131n ve resm\xEE sa\u011Fl\u0131k rehberleri incelendi. Bulgular \xF6zg\xFCn g\xFCnl\xFCk al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131rmalara uyarland\u0131. ODA kurslar\u0131n\u0131n kendisi klinik olarak s\u0131nanmad\u0131; e\u011Fitim ve ki\u015Fisel \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma i\xE7indir.",
        "Source": "Kaynak",
        "5\u20139 minutes for yourself in each lesson.": "Her derste kendine ay\u0131raca\u011F\u0131n 5\u20139 dakika.",
        "Technique": "Teknik",
        "What research says": "Ara\u015Ft\u0131rmalar ne diyor",
        "Technique from a book or teacher": "Kitaptan ya da \xF6\u011Fretmenden teknik",
        "Smart timing": "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 zamanlama",
        "At most two reminders a day: a morning nudge if you haven\u2019t chosen yet, and one around {time}, before you usually keep your decision. Nothing once it\u2019s done.": "G\xFCnde en fazla iki hat\u0131rlatma: hen\xFCz se\xE7mediysen sabah bir tane, bir de genelde karar\u0131n\u0131 tuttu\u011Fun saatten \xF6nce, {time} civar\u0131nda. Karar tutulunca hi\xE7biri gelmez.",
        "At most two reminders a day: a morning nudge if you haven\u2019t chosen yet, and one in the evening. After three kept decisions, ODA learns your usual time.": "G\xFCnde en fazla iki hat\u0131rlatma: hen\xFCz se\xE7mediysen sabah bir tane, bir de ak\u015Fam. \xDC\xE7 karar tuttuktan sonra ODA senin saatini \xF6\u011Frenir.",
        "Smart timing applies on this device while ODA is open or installed. Background reminders from the server still use the times below.": "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 zamanlama bu cihazda, ODA a\xE7\u0131kken ya da y\xFCkl\xFCyken \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131r. Sunucudan gelen arka plan hat\u0131rlatmalar\u0131 h\xE2l\xE2 a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki saatleri kullan\u0131r.",
        "Try it in 20 seconds": "20 saniyede dene",
        "One decision. A small start. Proof.": "Tek karar. K\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7. Kan\u0131t.",
        "This is how every day in ODA works. Try one round before we set anything up.": "ODA'da her g\xFCn b\xF6yle ge\xE7er. Hi\xE7bir \u015Fey ayarlamadan \xF6nce bir tur dene.",
        "1. Pick a decision for today:": "1. Bug\xFCn i\xE7in bir karar se\xE7:",
        "2. Start \xB7 just 2 minutes": "2. Ba\u015Fla \xB7 sadece 2 dakika",
        "Here the two minutes pass in a few seconds.": "Denemede iki dakika birka\xE7 saniyede ge\xE7iyor.",
        "3. I did it": "3. Yapt\u0131m",
        "Your evidence tree: {n} leaves": "Kan\u0131t a\u011Fac\u0131n: {n} yaprak",
        "That\u2019s proof #1. Every kept decision adds a leaf to your tree. Small promises, kept, change how you see yourself.": "\u0130\u015Fte ilk kan\u0131t\u0131n. Tuttu\u011Fun her karar a\u011Fac\u0131na bir yaprak ekler. K\xFC\xE7\xFCk s\xF6zleri tuttuk\xE7a kendine bak\u0131\u015F\u0131n de\u011Fi\u015Fir.",
        "Let\u2019s begin": "Ba\u015Flayal\u0131m",
        "Skip the demo": "Denemeyi atla",
        "Who do you want to become?": "Nas\u0131l biri olmak istiyorsun?",
        "Pick the one that feels closest. We\u2019ll suggest where to start.": "Sana en yak\u0131n geleni se\xE7. Nereden ba\u015Flayaca\u011F\u0131n\u0131 \xF6nerelim.",
        "For a first day, easy is smart. Tap one:": "\u0130lk g\xFCn kolay se\xE7mek ak\u0131ll\u0131ca. Birine dokun:",
        "Notifications are blocked in the browser. You can allow them later in Settings.": "Bildirimler taray\u0131c\u0131da engelli. \u0130stersen sonra Ayarlar'dan a\xE7abilirsin.",
        "Done. ODA will remind you around {time}, at most twice a day.": "Tamam. ODA sana {time} civar\u0131nda hat\u0131rlatacak, g\xFCnde en fazla iki kez.",
        "Your first piece of proof": "\u0130lk kan\u0131t\u0131n",
        "Kept": "Tuttun",
        "Kept.": "Tuttun.",
        "You did what you said you would. Your evidence tree just grew its first leaf.": "S\xF6yledi\u011Fini yapt\u0131n. Kan\u0131t a\u011Fac\u0131n ilk yapra\u011F\u0131n\u0131 a\xE7t\u0131.",
        "Want to choose tomorrow\u2019s decision now?": "Yar\u0131n\u0131n karar\u0131n\u0131 \u015Fimdi se\xE7mek ister misin?",
        "Tomorrow I will\u2026": "Yar\u0131n\u2026",
        "Save for tomorrow": "Yar\u0131n i\xE7in kaydet",
        "Tomorrow\u2019s decision is waiting: \u201C{text}\u201D": "Yar\u0131n\u0131n karar\u0131 haz\u0131r: \u201C{text}\u201D",
        "Want a gentle reminder tomorrow around {time}? At most twice a day, never to guilt you.": "Yar\u0131n {time} civar\u0131nda nazik bir hat\u0131rlatma ister misin? G\xFCnde en fazla iki kez, asla su\xE7lamadan.",
        "Yes, remind me": "Evet, hat\u0131rlat",
        "Your chain is safe: this week\u2019s flex day covered yesterday.": "Zincirin sa\u011Flam: D\xFCn\xFC bu haftan\u0131n esnek g\xFCn\xFC kar\u015F\u0131lad\u0131.",
        "The easiest way back in, one tap:": "Geri d\xF6nmenin en kolay yolu, tek dokunu\u015F:",
        "Good morning. What\u2019s one small thing that would make today count?": "G\xFCnayd\u0131n. Bug\xFCn\xFC de\u011Ferli k\u0131lacak k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir \u015Fey ne olabilir?",
        "One decision is enough for today. Want to pick it now?": "Bug\xFCn i\xE7in tek bir karar yeter. \u015Eimdi se\xE7mek ister misin?",
        "Morning. Choose something small enough to finish, even on a busy day.": "G\xFCnayd\u0131n. Yo\u011Fun bir g\xFCnde bile bitirebilece\u011Fin kadar k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir \u015Fey se\xE7.",
        "How about two minutes for \u201C{title}\u201D now? Starting is the whole trick.": "\u015Eimdi \u201C{title}\u201D i\xE7in iki dakika ay\u0131rsan? B\xFCt\xFCn s\u0131r ba\u015Flamakta.",
        "There\u2019s still time for \u201C{title}\u201D. The smallest version counts too.": "\u201C{title}\u201D i\xE7in h\xE2l\xE2 vakit var. En k\xFC\xE7\xFCk h\xE2li de say\u0131l\u0131r.",
        "No catching up needed. One small decision today is a fresh start.": "Telafi etmen gerekmiyor. Bug\xFCn k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir karar, temiz bir ba\u015Flang\u0131\xE7t\u0131r.",
        "Welcome back. Pick the easiest thing you can finish today.": "Tekrar ho\u015F geldin. Bug\xFCn bitirebilece\u011Fin en kolay \u015Feyi se\xE7.",
        "You did what you said you would. That\u2019s the whole point.": "S\xF6yledi\u011Fini yapt\u0131n. Mesele tam olarak bu.",
        "Another promise kept. Quietly, that\u2019s how people change.": "Bir s\xF6z daha tutuldu. \u0130nsanlar sessizce b\xF6yle de\u011Fi\u015Fir.",
        "Done. Your future self just got one more piece of proof.": "Tamam. Gelecekteki sen bir kan\u0131t daha kazand\u0131.",
        "Someone who finishes what they start": "Ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 bitiren biri",
        "Calmer and steadier": "Daha sakin ve dengeli biri",
        "Someone who trusts themselves": "Kendine g\xFCvenen biri",
        "Focused, able to do deep work": "Odaklan\u0131p derin \xE7al\u0131\u015Fabilen biri",
        "Rested and full of energy": "Dinlenmi\u015F ve enerji dolu biri",
        "Taking the first step toward a dream": "Hayaline ilk ad\u0131m\u0131 atan biri",
        "Drink a full glass of water": "Bir bardak su i\xE7ece\u011Fim",
        "Walk for 2 minutes": "2 dakika y\xFCr\xFCyece\u011Fim",
        "Send one message I\u2019ve been putting off": "Erteledi\u011Fim bir mesaj\u0131 g\xF6nderece\u011Fim",
        "Open the task I\u2019ve been avoiding for 2 minutes": "Ka\xE7\u0131nd\u0131\u011F\u0131m i\u015Fi 2 dakikal\u0131\u011F\u0131na a\xE7aca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Send one email I\u2019ve been putting off": "Erteledi\u011Fim bir e-postay\u0131 g\xF6nderece\u011Fim",
        "Write the first line of the thing I\u2019m delaying": "Erteledi\u011Fim i\u015Fin ilk sat\u0131r\u0131n\u0131 yazaca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Take 5 slow breaths with a long exhale": "Nefesimi uzun vererek 5 yava\u015F nefes alaca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Walk for 10 minutes without my phone": "Telefonsuz 10 dakika y\xFCr\xFCyece\u011Fim",
        "Drink a glass of water by the window": "Pencere kenar\u0131nda bir bardak su i\xE7ece\u011Fim",
        "Say one idea out loud in a conversation": "Bir sohbette bir fikrimi sesli s\xF6yleyece\u011Fim",
        "Write down one thing I did well today": "Bug\xFCn iyi yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131m bir \u015Feyi yazaca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Ask one question I usually keep to myself": "Genelde i\xE7imde tuttu\u011Fum bir soruyu soraca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Work 10 minutes with my phone in another room": "Telefon ba\u015Fka odadayken 10 dakika \xE7al\u0131\u015Faca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Turn off notifications for one work block": "Bir \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma seans\u0131 boyunca bildirimleri kapataca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Clear my desk before I start": "Ba\u015Flamadan \xF6nce masam\u0131 toparlayaca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Go outside for 10 minutes of daylight": "10 dakika d\u0131\u015Far\u0131 \xE7\u0131k\u0131p g\xFCn \u0131\u015F\u0131\u011F\u0131 alaca\u011F\u0131m",
        "No coffee after 2 pm today": "Bug\xFCn saat 14'ten sonra kahve i\xE7meyece\u011Fim",
        "Put my phone away 30 minutes before bed": "Yatmadan 30 dakika \xF6nce telefonu b\u0131rakaca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Spend 5 minutes on my dream\u2019s first step": "Hayalimin ilk ad\u0131m\u0131na 5 dakika ay\u0131raca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Write my dream\u2019s first real step on paper": "Hayalimin ilk ger\xE7ek ad\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 k\xE2\u011F\u0131da yazaca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Tell one person about the dream I\u2019m starting": "Ba\u015Flad\u0131\u011F\u0131m hayali bir ki\u015Fiye anlataca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Stand up and stretch for 1 minute": "Kalk\u0131p 1 dakika gerinece\u011Fim",
        "Write one sentence about how I feel": "Nas\u0131l hissetti\u011Fimi tek c\xFCmleyle yazaca\u011F\u0131m",
        "Suggested for you": "Senin i\xE7in \xF6nerilen",
        "Your tree grows one leaf for every decision you keep.": "Tuttu\u011Fun her kararla a\u011Fac\u0131nda bir yaprak a\xE7ar.",
        "{n} leaves, one for each promise you kept.": "{n} yaprak, tuttu\u011Fun her s\xF6z i\xE7in bir tane.",
        "A full tree. Every new promise now adds a blossom.": "A\u011Fac\u0131n doldu. Art\u0131k her yeni s\xF6zle bir \xE7i\xE7ek a\xE7\u0131yor.",
        "Current chain: {n} days": "\u015Eu anki zincir: {n} g\xFCn",
        "flex day used": "esnek g\xFCn kullan\u0131ld\u0131",
        "Your chain: one missed day a week is forgiven, two in a row start a new chain.": "Zincirin: Haftada bir g\xFCn ka\xE7\u0131rmak sorun de\u011Fil; \xFCst \xFCste iki g\xFCn ka\xE7arsa zincir yeniden ba\u015Flar.",
        "You chose this last night": "D\xFCn ak\u015Fam bunu se\xE7mi\u015Ftin",
        "Or start with something easy": "Ya da kolay bir \u015Feyle ba\u015Fla",
        "Use headphones for binaural sounds": "Binaural sesler i\xE7in kulakl\u0131k kullan",
        "Inhale": "Nefes al",
        "Exhale": "Nefes ver",
        "Ready when you are": "Haz\u0131r oldu\u011Funda ba\u015Fla",
        "5.5 seconds in \xB7 5.5 seconds out \xB7 about 5.5 breaths a minute": "5,5 saniye al \xB7 5,5 saniye ver \xB7 dakikada yakla\u015F\u0131k 5,5 nefes",
        "Pause the tone": "Sesi duraklat",
        "Start with the tone": "Sesle ba\u015Fla",
        "Stop the silent guide": "Sessiz rehberi durdur",
        "Silent guide": "Sessiz rehber",
        "Breathe gently through your nose if you can. If you feel light-headed, return to your normal breathing.": "Yapabiliyorsan burnundan yumu\u015Fak\xE7a nefes al. Ba\u015F\u0131n d\xF6nerse normal nefesine d\xF6n.",
        "Choose a sound to begin": "Ba\u015Flamak i\xE7in bir ses se\xE7",
        "Playing \xB7 no timer": "\xC7al\u0131yor \xB7 zamanlay\u0131c\u0131 yok",
        "Sound player": "Ses oynat\u0131c\u0131",
        "Sound Room": "Ses Odas\u0131",
        "Play": "Oynat",
        "Volume": "Ses d\xFCzeyi",
        "No timer": "Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131 yok",
        "Sound for calm, sleep and focus": "Sakinlik, uyku ve odak i\xE7in sesler",
        "Sound can help you relax, settle and fall asleep more easily. It is not a treatment.": "Ses; gev\u015Femene, sakinle\u015Fmene ve daha kolay uykuya dalmana yard\u0131m edebilir. Bir tedavi de\u011Fildir.",
        "Sound Room sections": "Ses Odas\u0131 b\xF6l\xFCmleri",
        "Pick a timer in the player below. The sound fades out gently over the last minute.": "A\u015Fa\u011F\u0131daki oynat\u0131c\u0131dan bir zamanlay\u0131c\u0131 se\xE7. Ses son dakikada yava\u015F\xE7a k\u0131s\u0131l\u0131r.",
        "Tones from sound-healing traditions": "Sesle \u015Fifa geleneklerinden tonlar",
        "About these frequencies": "Bu frekanslar hakk\u0131nda",
        "These tones come from sound-healing traditions. There is no scientific evidence that a specific frequency heals the body or repairs DNA. Many people still find them calming, and that is reason enough to listen.": "Bu tonlar sesle \u015Fifa geleneklerinden gelir. Belirli bir frekans\u0131n bedeni iyile\u015Ftirdi\u011Fine ya da DNA'y\u0131 onard\u0131\u011F\u0131na dair bilimsel bir kan\u0131t yok. Yine de pek \xE7ok ki\u015Fi onlar\u0131 sakinle\u015Ftirici buluyor; dinlemek i\xE7in bu da yeterli bir sebep.",
        "What the research says": "Ara\u015Ft\u0131rmalar ne diyor",
        "Garcia-Argibay, Santed and Reales (2019, Psychological Research) combined 22 studies of binaural beats and found a medium overall effect (g = 0.45) on anxiety, pain perception, memory and attention. The effect depended on the beat frequency and on when and how long people listened.": "Garcia-Argibay, Santed ve Reales (2019, Psychological Research), binaural vuru\u015Flar \xFCzerine 22 \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmay\u0131 bir araya getirdi ve kayg\u0131, a\u011Fr\u0131 alg\u0131s\u0131, bellek ve dikkat \xFCzerinde orta d\xFCzeyde genel bir etki buldu (g = 0,45). Etki; vuru\u015F frekans\u0131na, ne zaman ve ne kadar s\xFCre dinlendi\u011Fine ba\u011Fl\u0131yd\u0131.",
        "de Witte and colleagues (2025, eClinicalMedicine) combined 51 studies with 3,276 participants and found that music therapy reduced anxiety (g \u2248 0.36); listening-based (receptive) methods showed g \u2248 0.42. These were sessions with trained music therapists, not an app.": "de Witte ve arkada\u015Flar\u0131 (2025, eClinicalMedicine), 3.276 kat\u0131l\u0131mc\u0131l\u0131 51 \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmay\u0131 bir araya getirdi ve m\xFCzik terapisinin kayg\u0131y\u0131 azaltt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 buldu (g \u2248 0,36); dinlemeye dayal\u0131 (al\u0131c\u0131) y\xF6ntemlerde g \u2248 0,42 idi. Bunlar bir uygulama de\u011Fil, e\u011Fitimli m\xFCzik terapistleriyle yap\u0131lan seanslard\u0131.",
        "Zaccaro and colleagues (2018, Frontiers in Human Neuroscience) reviewed 15 studies: breathing slower than 10 breaths a minute went with higher heart-rate variability, more relaxation and less anxiety.": "Zaccaro ve arkada\u015Flar\u0131 (2018, Frontiers in Human Neuroscience) 15 \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmay\u0131 inceledi: dakikada 10 nefesten yava\u015F solumak; daha y\xFCksek kalp at\u0131\u015F h\u0131z\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Fkenli\u011Fi, daha fazla rahatlama ve daha az kayg\u0131yla birlikte g\xF6r\xFCld\xFC.",
        "Studies are small and varied. Treat these sounds as a way to relax, not as a cure.": "\xC7al\u0131\u015Fmalar k\xFC\xE7\xFCk ve birbirinden farkl\u0131. Bu sesleri bir tedavi de\u011Fil, rahatlaman\u0131n bir yolu olarak g\xF6r.",
        "Keep the volume low. Do not use binaural or sleep sounds while driving or doing anything that needs your full attention. Stop if you feel any discomfort.": "Sesi d\xFC\u015F\xFCk tut. Araba kullan\u0131rken ya da t\xFCm dikkatini isteyen bir i\u015F yaparken binaural veya uyku seslerini kullanma. Rahats\u0131zl\u0131k hissedersen dinlemeyi b\u0131rak.",
        "A wide, still lake at sunset": "G\xFCn bat\u0131m\u0131nda geni\u015F, durgun bir g\xF6l",
        "A woman wearing white headphones, eyes closed": "G\xF6zleri kapal\u0131, beyaz kulakl\u0131k takm\u0131\u015F bir kad\u0131n",
        "Open sea under a wide sky": "Geni\u015F bir g\xF6ky\xFCz\xFC alt\u0131nda a\xE7\u0131k deniz",
        "Misty mountains reflected in a calm lake at dusk": "Alacakaranl\u0131kta durgun bir g\xF6le yans\u0131yan sisli da\u011Flar",
        "Hands holding a brass singing bowl": "Pirin\xE7 bir tibet \xE7ana\u011F\u0131n\u0131 tutan eller",
        "A crescent moon above soft purple clouds": "Yumu\u015Fak mor bulutlar\u0131n \xFCzerinde bir hilal",
        "A soft pink and white cloud": "Yumu\u015Fak pembe beyaz bir bulut",
        "Rolling desert dunes": "Dalga dalga uzanan \xE7\xF6l kumullar\u0131",
        "Raindrops on a window": "Pencerede ya\u011Fmur damlalar\u0131",
        "A fire burning in a fireplace": "\u015E\xF6minede yanan bir ate\u015F",
        "Pine trees in morning mist": "Sabah sisinde \xE7am a\u011Fa\xE7lar\u0131",
        "Mountain silhouettes at sunset": "G\xFCn bat\u0131m\u0131nda da\u011F siluetleri",
        "A smooth stone in a clear stream": "Berrak bir derede p\xFCr\xFCzs\xFCz bir ta\u015F",
        "A meadow full of wildflowers": "K\u0131r \xE7i\xE7ekleriyle dolu bir \xE7ay\u0131r",
        "The Milky Way over still water": "Durgun suyun \xFCzerinde Samanyolu",
        "Alpha beat \xB7 10 Hz": "Alfa vuru\u015Fu \xB7 10 Hz",
        "Two soft tones, 216 Hz and 226 Hz, one in each ear.": "Her kulakta bir tane olmak \xFCzere iki yumu\u015Fak ton: 216 Hz ve 226 Hz.",
        "Studies link binaural beats to lower anxiety; results depend on the frequency and how long you listen.": "\xC7al\u0131\u015Fmalar binaural vuru\u015Flar\u0131 daha d\xFC\u015F\xFCk kayg\u0131yla ili\u015Fkilendiriyor; sonu\xE7lar frekansa ve ne kadar dinledi\u011Fine ba\u011Fl\u0131.",
        "Ocean waves": "Okyanus dalgalar\u0131",
        "A slow swell of surf, rising and falling about every ten seconds.": "Yakla\u015F\u0131k on saniyede bir y\xFCkselip al\xE7alan, a\u011F\u0131r a\u011F\u0131r kabaran dalgalar.",
        "A slow, predictable rhythm gives your attention somewhere easy to rest.": "Yava\u015F ve \xF6ng\xF6r\xFClebilir bir ritim, dikkatinin kolayca dinlenebilece\u011Fi bir yer a\xE7ar.",
        "Warm drone \xB7 432 Hz": "S\u0131cak ton \xB7 432 Hz",
        "A warm 432 Hz drone with a soft bowl every half minute.": "Yar\u0131m dakikada bir yumu\u015Fak bir \xE7anak sesinin e\u015Flik etti\u011Fi, s\u0131cak ve s\xFCrekli bir 432 Hz tonu.",
        "A steady, warm drone is easy to settle into. 432 Hz itself is not proven to be special.": "Sabit, s\u0131cak bir tona kendini b\u0131rakmak kolayd\u0131r. 432 Hz'in kendisinin \xF6zel oldu\u011Fu kan\u0131tlanm\u0131\u015F de\u011Fil.",
        "Singing bowls": "Tibet \xE7anaklar\u0131",
        "A low drone with a singing bowl struck every 18 seconds.": "Her 18 saniyede bir \xE7al\u0131nan tibet \xE7ana\u011F\u0131yla derin, s\xFCrekli bir ton.",
        "Following a long tone until it fades is a simple way to anchor your attention.": "Uzun bir tonu s\xF6nene kadar takip etmek, dikkatini sabitlemenin basit bir yoludur.",
        "Delta beat \xB7 2 Hz": "Delta vuru\u015Fu \xB7 2 Hz",
        "Very low tones, 100 Hz and 102 Hz, over a soft brown-noise bed.": "Yumu\u015Fak bir kahverengi g\xFCr\xFClt\xFC zemini \xFCzerinde \xE7ok pes tonlar: 100 Hz ve 102 Hz.",
        "Low, quiet sound for winding down. Evidence that delta beats improve sleep is still limited.": "Gev\u015Femek i\xE7in pes ve k\u0131s\u0131k bir ses. Delta vuru\u015Flar\u0131n\u0131n uykuyu iyile\u015Ftirdi\u011Fine dair kan\u0131tlar hen\xFCz s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131.",
        "Pink noise": "Pembe g\xFCr\xFClt\xFC",
        "An even, soft hiss, gentler and deeper than white noise.": "Beyaz g\xFCr\xFClt\xFCden daha yumu\u015Fak ve derin, dengeli bir h\u0131\u015F\u0131rt\u0131.",
        "Steady sound can cover sudden noises that might wake you.": "Sabit bir ses, seni uyand\u0131rabilecek ani g\xFCr\xFClt\xFCleri \xF6rtebilir.",
        "Brown noise": "Kahverengi g\xFCr\xFClt\xFC",
        "A deep, low rumble, like a distant waterfall.": "Uzaktaki bir \u015Felale gibi derin, pes bir u\u011Fultu.",
        "Low, even noise covers traffic and household sounds.": "Pes ve dengeli g\xFCr\xFClt\xFC, trafik ve ev seslerini \xF6rter.",
        "Light, steady rain against a window.": "Pencereye vuran hafif, d\xFCzenli ya\u011Fmur.",
        "A familiar, harmless sound that makes it easier to let the day go.": "G\xFCn\xFC geride b\u0131rakmay\u0131 kolayla\u015Ft\u0131ran tan\u0131d\u0131k, zarars\u0131z bir ses.",
        "Relax": "Rahatla",
        "Slow, steady sound to help your body settle.": "Bedeninin sakinle\u015Fmesine yard\u0131m eden yava\u015F, sabit sesler.",
        "Low, even sound for winding down. Set a timer and it fades out over the last minute.": "Gev\u015Femek i\xE7in pes, dengeli sesler. Zamanlay\u0131c\u0131 kurarsan ses son dakikada yava\u015F\xE7a k\u0131s\u0131l\u0131r.",
        "Steady sound that masks chatter and small noises while you work.": "\xC7al\u0131\u015F\u0131rken konu\u015Fmalar\u0131 ve k\xFC\xE7\xFCk g\xFCr\xFClt\xFCleri \xF6rten sabit sesler.",
        "Many people find a low, steady wall of sound easier to work in than silence.": "Pek \xE7ok ki\u015Fi pes ve sabit bir ses duvar\u0131yla \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmay\u0131 sessizlikten daha kolay buluyor.",
        "Masks voices and background noise, so less pulls at your attention.": "Konu\u015Fmalar\u0131 ve arka plan g\xFCr\xFClt\xFCs\xFCn\xFC \xF6rter; dikkatin daha az da\u011F\u0131l\u0131r.",
        "The low crackle of a wood fire.": "Odun ate\u015Finin hafif \xE7\u0131t\u0131rt\u0131s\u0131.",
        "A cosy, irregular crackle that keeps a quiet room from feeling empty.": "Sessiz bir oday\u0131 bo\u015F hissettirmeyen s\u0131cac\u0131k, d\xFCzensiz bir \xE7\u0131t\u0131rt\u0131.",
        "A soft, varied texture that covers distractions without asking for attention.": "Dikkatini \xE7ekmeden \xE7evredeki sesleri \xF6rten, yumu\u015Fak ve de\u011Fi\u015Fken bir doku.",
        "Breathe with the circle and the tone: in for 5.5 seconds, out for 5.5 seconds.": "Daire ve sesle birlikte nefes al: 5,5 saniye al, 5,5 saniye ver.",
        "Breath pacer": "Nefes ritmi",
        "A soft tone that rises as you breathe in and falls as you breathe out.": "Nefes al\u0131rken y\xFCkselen, verirken al\xE7alan yumu\u015Fak bir ton.",
        "Breathing slowly, under 10 breaths a minute, is linked to feeling calmer and more relaxed.": "Dakikada 10 nefesin alt\u0131nda, yava\u015F nefes almak daha sakin ve rahat hissetmeyle ili\u015Fkilendiriliyor.",
        "Offered for calm and curiosity, not as medicine.": "\u0130la\xE7 olarak de\u011Fil; sakinlik ve merak i\xE7in sunuluyor.",
        "Some musicians prefer tuning to 432 Hz. Claims that it heals are not supported by evidence.": "Baz\u0131 m\xFCzisyenler akordu 432 Hz'e g\xF6re yapmay\u0131 tercih ediyor. \u0130yile\u015Ftirdi\u011Fi iddialar\u0131 kan\u0131tlarla desteklenmiyor.",
        "A 528 Hz tone with a soft shimmer and bowl strikes.": "Yumu\u015Fak bir par\u0131lt\u0131 ve \xE7anak vuru\u015Flar\u0131yla 528 Hz'lik bir ton.",
        "Called the \u201Clove frequency\u201D in sound-healing circles. Enjoy it as a pleasant tone.": "Sesle \u015Fifa \xE7evrelerinde \u201Ca\u015Fk frekans\u0131\u201D diye an\u0131l\u0131r. Ho\u015F bir ton olarak tad\u0131n\u0131 \xE7\u0131kar.",
        "A grounded 396 Hz tone with low harmonics.": "Pes armonikli, dingin bir 396 Hz tonu.",
        "Linked to \u201Cletting go of fear\u201D in the solfeggio tradition.": "Solfej gelene\u011Finde \u201Ckorkuyu b\u0131rakmak\u201D ile ili\u015Fkilendirilir.",
        "A bright 639 Hz tone with gentle chimes.": "Yumu\u015Fak \xE7\u0131nlamalarla parlak bir 639 Hz tonu.",
        "Linked to \u201Cconnection\u201D in the solfeggio tradition.": "Solfej gelene\u011Finde \u201Cba\u011F kurmak\u201D ile ili\u015Fkilendirilir.",
        "Theta beat \xB7 6 Hz": "Teta vuru\u015Fu \xB7 6 Hz",
        "A 6 Hz binaural beat on warm, low tones.": "S\u0131cak, pes tonlar \xFCzerinde 6 Hz'lik bir binaural vuru\u015F.",
