        "Dream Dollars you earn by keeping your word, and real money plans.": "S\xF6z\xFCn\xFC tutarak kazand\u0131\u011F\u0131n Hayal Dolarlar\u0131 ve ger\xE7ek para planlar\u0131.",
        "Eight areas of life, rated by you, for you.": "Hayat\u0131n sekiz alan\u0131; senin puan\u0131nla, senin i\xE7in.",
