        "Payment is charged to your Apple ID. The subscription renews automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the period; manage or cancel it any time in your Apple ID settings.": "\xD6deme Apple Kimli\u011Fi hesab\u0131ndan al\u0131n\u0131r. Abonelik, d\xF6nem bitmeden en az 24 saat \xF6nce iptal edilmezse otomatik olarak yenilenir; Apple Kimli\u011Fi ayarlar\u0131ndan istedi\u011Fin an y\xF6netebilir ya da iptal edebilirsin.",
