        "Edit how you are arriving": "Nas\u0131l geldi\u011Fini d\xFCzenle",
        "How are you arriving?": "Bug\xFCne nas\u0131l geliyorsun?",
        "Tap your energy. It takes one second.": "Enerjine dokun. Bir saniye s\xFCrer.",
        "Low energy is a fine place to start. Make today\u2019s decision the 2-minute version.": "D\xFC\u015F\xFCk enerji ba\u015Flamak i\xE7in uygun bir yer. Bug\xFCn\xFCn karar\u0131n\u0131 2 dakikal\u0131k haline getir.",
        "On a low day, choose something very small. It still counts.": "D\xFC\u015F\xFCk bir g\xFCnde \xE7ok k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir \u015Fey se\xE7. Yine de say\u0131l\u0131r.",
        "Today\u2019s decision is kept. Rest counts too. A few quiet minutes might help.": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn karar\u0131n\u0131 tuttun. Dinlenmek de say\u0131l\u0131r. Birka\xE7 sakin dakika iyi gelebilir.",
        "Open the Sound Room": "Ses Odas\u0131\u2019n\u0131 a\xE7",
        "Go gently today. Make the decision the 2-minute version, or start with a few quiet minutes.": "Bug\xFCn nazik ol. Karar\u0131 2 dakikal\u0131k haline getir ya da birka\xE7 sakin dakikayla ba\u015Fla.",
        "A steady day. Do today\u2019s decision first, and let the rest follow.": "Dengeli bir g\xFCn. \xD6nce bug\xFCn\xFCn karar\u0131n\u0131 yap, gerisi kendili\u011Finden gelir.",
