        "You have some energy today. A short lesson is a good way to use it.": "Bug\xFCn biraz enerjin var. K\u0131sa bir ders onu de\u011Ferlendirmenin g\xFCzel bir yolu.",
        "Open: {title}": "A\xE7: {title}",
        "Open a lesson": "Bir ders a\xE7",
        "And your mood? Optional.": "Peki ruh halin? \u0130ste\u011Fe ba\u011Fl\u0131.",
        "One line about today": "Bug\xFCn hakk\u0131nda tek sat\u0131r",
        "Whatever stayed with you. It goes into your notebook.": "Akl\u0131nda kalan her \u015Fey. Defterine eklenir.",
        "Today I\u2026": "Bug\xFCn ben\u2026",
        "Added to today\u2019s page in your notebook.": "Defterindeki bug\xFCn\xFCn sayfas\u0131na eklendi.",
        "Today\u2019s prompt": "Bug\xFCn\xFCn sorusu",
        "Use this prompt": "Bu soruyu kullan",
        "{month}: written on {n} of {total} days so far. Days: {days}.": "{month}: \u015Fimdiye kadar {total} g\xFCn\xFCn {n} g\xFCn\xFCnde yaz\u0131ld\u0131. G\xFCnler: {days}.",
        "{month}: no writing yet this month.": "{month}: bu ay hen\xFCz yaz\u0131 yok.",
        "What is one small thing that went better than I expected this week?": "Bu hafta bekledi\u011Fimden daha iyi giden k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir \u015Fey ne oldu?",
        "Which promise to myself am I quietly proud of keeping?": "Kendime verdi\u011Fim hangi s\xF6z\xFC tuttu\u011Fum i\xE7in sessizce gurur duyuyorum?",
        "What would I do today if I trusted myself a little more?": "Kendime biraz daha g\xFCvenseydim bug\xFCn ne yapard\u0131m?",
        "Who has made my life easier lately, and what would I like them to know?": "Son zamanlarda hayat\u0131m\u0131 kim kolayla\u015Ft\u0131rd\u0131 ve ona neyi bilmesini isterdim?",
        "What am I carrying that I could set down for one evening?": "Ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131m hangi y\xFCk\xFC bir ak\u015Faml\u0131\u011F\u0131na b\u0131rakabilirim?",
        "Describe a moment today when I felt most like myself.": "Bug\xFCn kendim gibi hissetti\u011Fim en belirgin an\u0131 anlat.",
        "What is the kindest thing I could say to myself right now?": "\u015Eu an kendime s\xF6yleyebilece\u011Fim en nazik s\xF6z ne olurdu?",
        "What did I avoid this week, and what is the smallest first step toward it?": "Bu hafta neyden ka\xE7\u0131nd\u0131m ve ona do\u011Fru at\u0131lacak en k\xFC\xE7\xFCk ilk ad\u0131m ne?",
        "Which ordinary part of my day would I miss if it were gone?": "G\xFCn\xFCm\xFCn hangi s\u0131radan par\xE7as\u0131 olmasa \xF6zlerdim?",
        "What do I want more of in my days, and what could I do about it today?": "G\xFCnlerimde nelerin daha fazlas\u0131n\u0131 istiyorum ve bug\xFCn bunun i\xE7in ne yapabilirim?",
        "When did I last feel calm, and what was around me?": "En son ne zaman sakin hissettim ve etraf\u0131mda ne vard\u0131?",
        "What is a decision I made recently that I would make again?": "Yak\u0131n zamanda verdi\u011Fim ve yine verirdim diyece\u011Fim bir karar ne?",
        "What am I learning about myself that I did not know a year ago?": "Bir y\u0131l \xF6nce bilmedi\u011Fim, kendim hakk\u0131nda neyi \xF6\u011Freniyorum?",
        "Write about a place where I feel safe, and what makes it so.": "Kendimi g\xFCvende hissetti\u011Fim bir yeri ve onu b\xF6yle yapan \u015Feyi yaz.",
        "What would a good day look like, in detail, from waking to sleep?": "\u0130yi bir g\xFCn, uyanmaktan uyumaya kadar ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar\u0131yla nas\u0131l g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCrd\xFC?",
        "Which worry is loudest today, and what is actually within my control?": "Bug\xFCn en y\xFCksek sesle konu\u015Fan endi\u015Fe hangisi ve ger\xE7ekte neler benim elimde?",
        "What is one thing I can forgive myself for?": "Kendimi affedebilece\u011Fim bir \u015Fey ne?",
        "Who do I want to become a little more like, and what do they do differently?": "Kime biraz daha benzemek istiyorum ve o farkl\u0131 olarak ne yap\u0131yor?",
        "What made me smile today, however briefly?": "Bug\xFCn, ne kadar k\u0131sa da olsa, beni ne g\xFCl\xFCmsetti?",
        "What does rest look like for me, and when did I last allow it?": "Benim i\xE7in dinlenmek neye benziyor ve en son ne zaman buna izin verdim?",
        "What would I tell a close friend who was in my exact situation?": "Tam benim durumumda olan yak\u0131n bir arkada\u015F\u0131ma ne s\xF6ylerdim?",
        "What is a small courage I showed recently that no one noticed?": "Yak\u0131n zamanda g\xF6sterdi\u011Fim ve kimsenin fark etmedi\u011Fi k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir cesaret ne?",
        "What do I want to remember about this season of my life?": "Hayat\u0131m\u0131n bu d\xF6neminden neyi hat\u0131rlamak istiyorum?",
        "If tomorrow could start one small thing well, what would it be?": "Yar\u0131n k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir \u015Feyi iyi ba\u015Flatabilseydi, bu ne olurdu?",
